(287757, 20375, 772, '<td valign="top">I like ''rustic'' images and this old tractor is quite appealing to me.  I think there are probably a ton of good photo opportunities on it alone :)  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the overpowering level of red in the image.  The red on the tractor seems ''too red'' to me for some reason.  I suppose it could be the natural lighting of the environment.  The blue in the sky seems to be a bit weak, so maybe a polarizer would bring that out a little more :)</td>', 'I like ''rustic'' images and this old tractor is quite appealing to me.  I think there are probably a ton of good photo opportunities on it alone :)  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the overpowering level of red in the image.  The red on the tractor seems ''too red'' to me for some reason.  I suppose it could be the natural lighting of the environment.  The blue in the sky seems to be a bit weak, so maybe a polarizer would bring that out a little more :)', '2003-05-05 09:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(287761, 20424, 656, '<td valign="top">I have to give you high marks, just for living in Milton Keynes (there has to be some compensation!)  <br/> <br/>A good entry, though I''d have liked to have seen the foreground flowers a bit more in focus and the dark shadow on the middle left seems out of place (I''m assuming its from something out of the frame to the left.</td>', 'I have to give you high marks, just for living in Milton Keynes (there has to be some compensation!)   A good entry, though I''d have liked to have seen the foreground flowers a bit more in focus and the dark shadow on the middle left seems out of place (I''m assuming its from something out of the frame to the left.', '2003-05-05 09:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(287764, 20168, 5176, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective  I think the text is a little weak and lets down a dramatic picture</td>', 'Fantastic perspective  I think the text is a little weak and lets down a dramatic picture', '2003-05-05 09:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(287765, 20456, 656, '<td valign="top">Nicely done .   Well exposed sky, good use of the foreground flowers to add some interest</td>', 'Nicely done .   Well exposed sky, good use of the foreground flowers to add some interest', '2003-05-05 09:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(287767, 20298, 656, '<td valign="top">This is good, but could you have gotten closer to the yellow flowers to make them fill even more of the lower part of the composition ?</td>', 'This is good, but could you have gotten closer to the yellow flowers to make them fill even more of the lower part of the composition ?', '2003-05-05 10:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(287769, 20337, 656, '<td valign="top">seems to have a lot of text which tends to dominate the scene.</td>', 'seems to have a lot of text which tends to dominate the scene.', '2003-05-05 10:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(287770, 20363, 5176, '<td valign="top">I think the colours are a little bland and tend to wash out the detail</td>', 'I think the colours are a little bland and tend to wash out the detail', '2003-05-05 10:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(287771, 20422, 5176, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture great sentiment but which city? does it meet the challenge?</td>', 'Excellent picture great sentiment but which city? does it meet the challenge?', '2003-05-05 10:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(287773, 20419, 656, '<td valign="top">Great subject to work with.  Think this could be improved by shooting at a different time of day though.  The sky is not very interesting and there is a lot of shadows.<br/> <br/>Either that or you could have moved the castle higher in the sky to get rid of some of the blue.  Would be great with a sunset/ sunrise though (fireworks being a bit hard to ask for with 1 weeks notice...)</td>', 'Great subject to work with.  Think this could be improved by shooting at a different time of day though.  The sky is not very interesting and there is a lot of shadows. Either that or you could have moved the castle higher in the sky to get rid of some of the blue.  Would be great with a sunset/ sunrise though (fireworks being a bit hard to ask for with 1 weeks notice...)', '2003-05-05 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(287774, 20411, 5176, '<td valign="top">Spot on for a post card challenge strong colours and subject</td>', 'Spot on for a post card challenge strong colours and subject', '2003-05-05 10:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(287776, 20368, 656, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great landscape, shame about the ferry in the way!  The mountains and pink sky make this stand out - good entry.</td>', 'Looks like a great landscape, shame about the ferry in the way!  The mountains and pink sky make this stand out - good entry.', '2003-05-05 10:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(287777, 20379, 5176, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit rushed the details seem abit lost in the composition</td>', 'This looks a bit rushed the details seem abit lost in the composition', '2003-05-05 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(287778, 20521, 5176, '<td valign="top">Nice classic postcard look</td>', 'Nice classic postcard look', '2003-05-05 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(287780, 20399, 2891, '<td valign="top">beautiful location, however the DOF needs to be adjusted.  the leaves in the front, just above middle to left really take away.  They keep pulling and holding my eyes.</td>', 'beautiful location, however the DOF needs to be adjusted.  the leaves in the front, just above middle to left really take away.  They keep pulling and holding my eyes.', '2003-05-05 10:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(287782, 20405, 2891, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  Focus is good through the entire picture.  I like the lines, especially the diagonals.  The stairs take me to the roof which takes me to the tower, thus hitting the entire image.</td>', 'Great perspective.  Focus is good through the entire picture.  I like the lines, especially the diagonals.  The stairs take me to the roof which takes me to the tower, thus hitting the entire image.', '2003-05-05 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(287783, 20437, 656, '<td valign="top">A good shot, good postcard.  I could see that this really glow with the right sunset hitting it.</td>', 'A good shot, good postcard.  I could see that this really glow with the right sunset hitting it.', '2003-05-05 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(287784, 20120, 2891, '<td valign="top">This could have used something to lessen the haze.  also, the picture is tilted down to the right, 2 maybe 3 degrees.  I also think the text is too much.  Lower left corner and smaller, maybe.<br/> <br/>I would love to visit Portland, BTW.</td>', 'This could have used something to lessen the haze.  also, the picture is tilted down to the right, 2 maybe 3 degrees.  I also think the text is too much.  Lower left corner and smaller, maybe. I would love to visit Portland, BTW.', '2003-05-05 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(287785, 20337, 2891, '<td valign="top">Too blue and hazy.</td>', 'Too blue and hazy.', '2003-05-05 10:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(287786, 20363, 2891, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clear perspective and focus.  I like the muted color, focusing on the purples of the flowering tree.</td>', 'Very nice, clear perspective and focus.  I like the muted color, focusing on the purples of the flowering tree.', '2003-05-05 10:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
