(287823, 20482, 656, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  You''ve abstracted the subject well and it still really communicates Texas.<br/> <br/>Looking back, this is may favourite entry by far - 10+</td>', 'I really like this.  You''ve abstracted the subject well and it still really communicates Texas. Looking back, this is may favourite entry by far - 10+', '2003-05-05 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(287831, 20370, 675, '<td valign="top">i don''t really like the border at all...i think it really takes away from the composition. the photo itself is good. the long exposure has a nice effect on the fountain and the fountain is a good contrast between the fore and background. also shooting the photo in order to more recognizable buildings in the background would help as well. i can see the hancock tower peaking out back there but it wouldn''t be recognizable to anyone outside of the chicago area. so overall the photo is really good...the border just cheapens it in my opinion. also there is no mention of chicago, so anyone who doesn''t know the pet name of the city would be a little confused</td>', 'i don''t really like the border at all...i think it really takes away from the composition. the photo itself is good. the long exposure has a nice effect on the fountain and the fountain is a good contrast between the fore and background. also shooting the photo in order to more recognizable buildings in the background would help as well. i can see the hancock tower peaking out back there but it wouldn''t be recognizable to anyone outside of the chicago area. so overall the photo is really good...the border just cheapens it in my opinion. also there is no mention of chicago, so anyone who doesn''t know the pet name of the city would be a little confused', '2003-05-05 11:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(287832, 20262, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very serene and inviting. A good choice for a postcard and it turned out well - 9.</td>', 'Very serene and inviting. A good choice for a postcard and it turned out well - 9.', '2003-05-05 11:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(287834, 20435, 5728, '<td valign="top">An excellent composition and beautiful postcard. The color combinations are awesome, well done.</td>', 'An excellent composition and beautiful postcard. The color combinations are awesome, well done.', '2003-05-05 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
