(287926, 20507, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice use of dof. The picture is good on its own, but I''m not sure it is the best representation of your town. IMO this could be just about any town in America, but maybe you just live in a really small, boring place  :) Also, a lot of the more "finished" looking shots in this challenge used frames nicely which makes it look more professional even if you wouldn''t really see it on a postcard.</td>', 'Nice use of dof. The picture is good on its own, but I''m not sure it is the best representation of your town. IMO this could be just about any town in America, but maybe you just live in a really small, boring place  :) Also, a lot of the more "finished" looking shots in this challenge used frames nicely which makes it look more professional even if you wouldn''t really see it on a postcard.', '2003-05-05 12:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
