(288016, 20154, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ooh yes, I have been there, this would be a nice card to sent home. :)<br/>I just love this area, the architecture, the gardens, the people, the weather.<br/> <br/>I think that the bird is a strong addition here. Its only a small spot on the whole image, but it gives more meaning and emotion to the whole setting. Nice.<br/></td>', 'Ooh yes, I have been there, this would be a nice card to sent home. :)I just love this area, the architecture, the gardens, the people, the weather. I think that the bird is a strong addition here. Its only a small spot on the whole image, but it gives more meaning and emotion to the whole setting. Nice.', '2003-05-05 13:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(288019, 20446, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent image... the only room for improvement I see woudl be to possibly cut off the dark bit at the bottom of the frame...</td>', 'excellent image... the only room for improvement I see woudl be to possibly cut off the dark bit at the bottom of the frame...', '2003-05-05 14:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288032, 20478, 811, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  My only suggestion would be for the text to be together.  Either all at the top, or all at the bottom.  Otherwise, very nicely done!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  My only suggestion would be for the text to be together.  Either all at the top, or all at the bottom.  Otherwise, very nicely done!', '2003-05-05 14:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288042, 20411, 5112, '<td valign="top">The colours are beautiful.  The font (letters) go well with the picture.  My one "negative" comment, I wish there were no shadow on the grass at the bottom right hand side of the picture.</td>', 'The colours are beautiful.  The font (letters) go well with the picture.  My one "negative" comment, I wish there were no shadow on the grass at the bottom right hand side of the picture.', '2003-05-05 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(288046, 20514, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of Billings (been there ... ).  I can''t decide whether or not I like the words - the font/outline almost seems to be too "dominant", although, postcards often have that characteristic.  Good work!</td>', 'Beautiful picture of Billings (been there ... ).  I can''t decide whether or not I like the words - the font/outline almost seems to be too "dominant", although, postcards often have that characteristic.  Good work!', '2003-05-05 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(288047, 20523, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful layout, nice framing!  I wish the church were clearer, or in better light.</td>', 'Beautiful layout, nice framing!  I wish the church were clearer, or in better light.', '2003-05-05 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288075, 20536, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this postcard, even though I think it''s not the best photo in this challenge (please don''t get offended :)  I like how the picture can be divided into two triangles (top left - bottom right).  The tower looks beautiful, but overall the picture looks a bit fuzzy, and the trees are so dark!  I love the lettering, it looks just right for the picture</td>', 'I like this postcard, even though I think it''s not the best photo in this challenge (please don''t get offended :)  I like how the picture can be divided into two triangles (top left - bottom right).  The tower looks beautiful, but overall the picture looks a bit fuzzy, and the trees are so dark!  I love the lettering, it looks just right for the picture', '2003-05-05 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288089, 20368, 5112, '<td valign="top">My daughter''s comment while we were going through the entries: "Wish I could see the island, not the ferry".  Nice picture, though, I love the clouds and the snowy mountain peaks!  One nitpicky comment:  move the text up just a little (make distance to top and left margins equal), and separate the two words a bit further from each other.</td>', 'My daughter''s comment while we were going through the entries: "Wish I could see the island, not the ferry".  Nice picture, though, I love the clouds and the snowy mountain peaks!  One nitpicky comment:  move the text up just a little (make distance to top and left margins equal), and separate the two words a bit further from each other.', '2003-05-05 14:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(288094, 20501, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good attempt at a postcard, but I think that the picture would be better not taken agains the sun.  The colour of the sky is beautiful.</td>', 'I think this is a good attempt at a postcard, but I think that the picture would be better not taken agains the sun.  The colour of the sky is beautiful.', '2003-05-05 14:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(288110, 20501, 4493, '<td valign="top">This image has a nice calm feel to it. I like the use of light on the waves. It almost has a nighttime feel to it. Your blues are deep and true. The use of thirds is good, not that it''s a rule, but for this presentation, having the horizon higher works nicely. Your horizon, however, doesn''t have enough detail or light to draw in the interest of the viewer. It is a dark line breaking up the two shades of blue from the sky and the water. <br/> <br/>For this image I would probably adjusted the levels some to bring out some of the details in the treeline. That, or find an area on the lake that has an interesting foreground element that would catch the viewers attention. This dark shot can work, with the proper foreground it just needs to be interesting enough to work with the sparkles on the water. <br/> <br/>Your layout of words on the left and thin black border work nicely.<br/> <br/>6 -danny</td>', 'This image has a nice calm feel to it. I like the use of light on the waves. It almost has a nighttime feel to it. Your blues are deep and true. The use of thirds is good, not that it''s a rule, but for this presentation, having the horizon higher works nicely. Your horizon, however, doesn''t have enough detail or light to draw in the interest of the viewer. It is a dark line breaking up the two shades of blue from the sky and the water.  For this image I would probably adjusted the levels some to bring out some of the details in the treeline. That, or find an area on the lake that has an interesting foreground element that would catch the viewers attention. This dark shot can work, with the proper foreground it just needs to be interesting enough to work with the sparkles on the water.  Your layout of words on the left and thin black border work nicely. 6 -danny', '2003-05-05 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(288163, 20112, 6565, '<td valign="top">I don''t get if the photo was taken in 1949 or the lighthouse was built then.  I really like the mood it sets, and the red at the top coordinating visually with the red at the bottom.  The muted colors work well for this image.</td>', 'I don''t get if the photo was taken in 1949 or the lighthouse was built then.  I really like the mood it sets, and the red at the top coordinating visually with the red at the bottom.  The muted colors work well for this image.', '2003-05-05 15:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(288167, 20267, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped this so that the mountains take up more of the image and the horizon is higher.  Sky is common to everywhere, but those amazing mountains are what really say Utah!</td>', 'I''d have cropped this so that the mountains take up more of the image and the horizon is higher.  Sky is common to everywhere, but those amazing mountains are what really say Utah!', '2003-05-05 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(288170, 20375, 6565, '<td valign="top">I think the saturation is up too high on this photo -- keep the contrast as-is so it''s sort of grainy and dreamlike, but tone the saturation down a bit.  Just my opinion. :)</td>', 'I think the saturation is up too high on this photo -- keep the contrast as-is so it''s sort of grainy and dreamlike, but tone the saturation down a bit.  Just my opinion. :)', '2003-05-05 15:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
