(288415, 20478, 4494, '<td valign="top">The text should say WHERE this is.  City and State, etc.</td>', 'The text should say WHERE this is.  City and State, etc.', '2003-05-05 20:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288417, 20111, 472, '<td valign="top">cool perspective. a little overexposed</td>', 'cool perspective. a little overexposed', '2003-05-05 20:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(288418, 20419, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should add ", Scotland" after "Edinburgh Castle".  I like the font.</td>', 'Should add ", Scotland" after "Edinburgh Castle".  I like the font.', '2003-05-05 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(288419, 20336, 472, '<td valign="top">gorgeous photo</td>', 'gorgeous photo', '2003-05-05 20:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(288420, 20253, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with a great border. The font matches the tone and style of the architecture wonderfully. This is a superb B/W image. Raising the point of view would give us more of the fancy building and less of the pier structure and supports.</td>', 'Lovely image with a great border. The font matches the tone and style of the architecture wonderfully. This is a superb B/W image. Raising the point of view would give us more of the fancy building and less of the pier structure and supports.', '2003-05-05 20:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(288421, 20440, 4494, '<td valign="top">The font is horrendous.  You shouldn''t say "Calif".  Better to use "CA".</td>', 'The font is horrendous.  You shouldn''t say "Calif".  Better to use "CA".', '2003-05-05 20:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(288422, 20504, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous composition! The echo of the building shapes not only is cool, it also gives a hint as to what Dallas is all about--both historical and modern interest. I want to go to Dallas now. If I come, can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag?</td>', 'Marvelous composition! The echo of the building shapes not only is cool, it also gives a hint as to what Dallas is all about--both historical and modern interest. I want to go to Dallas now. If I come, can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag?', '2003-05-05 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(288424, 20383, 4494, '<td valign="top">What town?  Great shot.</td>', 'What town?  Great shot.', '2003-05-05 20:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(288425, 20454, 472, '<td valign="top">nice picture. the big text is in kind of a weird place</td>', 'nice picture. the big text is in kind of a weird place', '2003-05-05 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288426, 20424, 6870, '<td valign="top">A wonder to behold for sure! YOur  image really makes me want to go and see this remarkable landmark. Nice point of view so close to the grass, and the focus is great.</td>', 'A wonder to behold for sure! YOur  image really makes me want to go and see this remarkable landmark. Nice point of view so close to the grass, and the focus is great.', '2003-05-05 20:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288428, 20419, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful image</td>', 'beautiful image', '2003-05-05 20:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(288430, 20456, 472, '<td valign="top">nice building shot.  text could be more precisely centered</td>', 'nice building shot.  text could be more precisely centered', '2003-05-05 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288431, 20331, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, a postcard wouldn''t say that. :D  Pretty interesting shot however.</td>', 'LOL, a postcard wouldn''t say that. :D  Pretty interesting shot however.', '2003-05-05 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(288432, 20422, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the title refers to, but this man really seems to embody this place, and makes me want to go there. Nice portraiture. Lighting, focus and colors are captured wonderfully.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the title refers to, but this man really seems to embody this place, and makes me want to go there. Nice portraiture. Lighting, focus and colors are captured wonderfully.', '2003-05-05 20:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(288433, 20368, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great one!  Love the color of the sky and boat.  Need to add the State in the caption (WA?)</td>', 'Great one!  Love the color of the sky and boat.  Need to add the State in the caption (WA?)', '2003-05-05 20:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(288434, 20210, 472, '<td valign="top">nice shot. a little washed out. the font is overpowering.  less is more here.</td>', 'nice shot. a little washed out. the font is overpowering.  less is more here.', '2003-05-05 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(288437, 20497, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lighting is slightly harsh, but the lines  in this shot are wonderful. Excellent point of view and nice DOF and focus.</td>', 'Lighting is slightly harsh, but the lines  in this shot are wonderful. Excellent point of view and nice DOF and focus.', '2003-05-05 20:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288438, 20417, 472, '<td valign="top">wow amazing shot. i think your font size detracts from the image.</td>', 'wow amazing shot. i think your font size detracts from the image.', '2003-05-05 20:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(288439, 20370, 6870, '<td valign="top">YOu make this town look enticing! Excellent use of color, light and point of view to make it all happen here.</td>', 'YOu make this town look enticing! Excellent use of color, light and point of view to make it all happen here.', '2003-05-05 20:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(288440, 20168, 472, '<td valign="top">nice abstract</td>', 'nice abstract', '2003-05-05 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(288441, 20446, 6870, '<td valign="top">YOu make Texas look so peaceful and nostalgic here with your soft lighting and wonderful use of focus and color.</td>', 'YOu make Texas look so peaceful and nostalgic here with your soft lighting and wonderful use of focus and color.', '2003-05-05 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288442, 20078, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, you''ve inspired me to look up where Hoorn harbor is. NIce lighting and intriguing subject make this an interesting shot.</td>', 'Okay, you''ve inspired me to look up where Hoorn harbor is. NIce lighting and intriguing subject make this an interesting shot.', '2003-05-05 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(288443, 20457, 4494, '<td valign="top">This one looks like a 70''s post card also, with the coloring and font.  Good job!</td>', 'This one looks like a 70''s post card also, with the coloring and font.  Good job!', '2003-05-05 20:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(288444, 20432, 6870, '<td valign="top">Centering this building gives it an importance that implies that this building is worth looking at in and of itself. Wonderful use of light, too.</td>', 'Centering this building gives it an importance that implies that this building is worth looking at in and of itself. Wonderful use of light, too.', '2003-05-05 20:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(288445, 20120, 4494, '<td valign="top">Amazing it isn''t raining. :)  Nice shot but looks a little tilted to the right.</td>', 'Amazing it isn''t raining. :)  Nice shot but looks a little tilted to the right.', '2003-05-05 20:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(288446, 20414, 4494, '<td valign="top">State?  It''s titled to the right also.  The font is kinda nice however.</td>', 'State?  It''s titled to the right also.  The font is kinda nice however.', '2003-05-05 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288447, 20269, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and font.  Where did you take the shot from?   This one will win most likely because it''s such a typical looking postcard.  Absolultely excellent, I''m jealous. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot and font.  Where did you take the shot from?   This one will win most likely because it''s such a typical looking postcard.  Absolultely excellent, I''m jealous. 10.', '2003-05-05 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288451, 20497, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent architectural photo... i love good architecture shots and this one is no exception.  the curves and the light / dark contrast are very strong together.  The composition you chose here accents the architecture nicely... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'excellent architectural photo... i love good architecture shots and this one is no exception.  the curves and the light / dark contrast are very strong together.  The composition you chose here accents the architecture nicely... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-05-05 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(288452, 20422, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image... I know nothing about where this was taken or what the ''postcard'' value of it is, but the image is definitely ''speaking'' to me... phenomenal work... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful image... I know nothing about where this was taken or what the ''postcard'' value of it is, but the image is definitely ''speaking'' to me... phenomenal work... = 10 - setzler', '2003-05-05 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288454, 20482, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is the winner, and not because I am a Texan.  It is beautifully photographed.<br/>A 10.  I also like your choice of script</td>', 'This is the winner, and not because I am a Texan.  It is beautifully photographed.A 10.  I also like your choice of script', '2003-05-05 20:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(288455, 20269, 6504, '<td valign="top">This looks exactly like a post card.  It is good and clear.  Well done.</td>', 'This looks exactly like a post card.  It is good and clear.  Well done.', '2003-05-05 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288456, 20268, 6504, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  It looks like a post card, a very good one.    10.</td>', 'Excellent.  It looks like a post card, a very good one.    10.', '2003-05-05 20:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(288461, 20112, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... I love postcard scenes that don''t have the strong ''cheezy touristy'' factor to them.  The subdued color on this one nicely enhances the ''old'' theme... excellent work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... I love postcard scenes that don''t have the strong ''cheezy touristy'' factor to them.  The subdued color on this one nicely enhances the ''old'' theme... excellent work :) - setzler', '2003-05-05 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(288463, 20168, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective on the arch... I think the blue cast works fairly well in this one but I would love to see it the other way as well :) - nice work...</td>', 'excellent perspective on the arch... I think the blue cast works fairly well in this one but I would love to see it the other way as well :) - nice work...', '2003-05-05 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
