(288524, 20336, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Good combination of fonts.</td>', 'Great colors.  Good combination of fonts.', '2003-05-05 21:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(288526, 20298, 6532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Serene.  Makes me want to plan a trip ...</td>', 'Beautiful.  Serene.  Makes me want to plan a trip ...', '2003-05-05 21:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288583, 20525, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition here--it gives a good "random" quality to these animals. The light is a bit harsh or the colors washed a bit, but you captured the essence of these animals here, and in so doing, captured the essence of Breckenridge, too.</td>', 'Wonderful composition here--it gives a good "random" quality to these animals. The light is a bit harsh or the colors washed a bit, but you captured the essence of these animals here, and in so doing, captured the essence of Breckenridge, too.', '2003-05-05 23:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288584, 20478, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of these falls, with which I am quite familiar! The font you used doesn''t seem to match the "essence" of the falls, but the composition and tones are wonderful. All in all, a very nice photo!</td>', 'Lovely photo of these falls, with which I am quite familiar! The font you used doesn''t seem to match the "essence" of the falls, but the composition and tones are wonderful. All in all, a very nice photo!', '2003-05-05 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288585, 20332, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of drama here, and it makes me want to go to Hawaii! I like the gritty, fire-eating look!</td>', 'Lots of drama here, and it makes me want to go to Hawaii! I like the gritty, fire-eating look!', '2003-05-05 23:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288586, 20442, 6870, '<td valign="top">One aspect of New England is represented here very nicely through your use of line and space. Nice work!</td>', 'One aspect of New England is represented here very nicely through your use of line and space. Nice work!', '2003-05-05 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(288587, 20482, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and well executed.Tones are really nice and the font is perfect.</td>', 'Clever idea, and well executed.Tones are really nice and the font is perfect.', '2003-05-05 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288588, 19947, 6870, '<td valign="top">THis image gives me a feeling of peace and comfort. If that is what Groningen is all about, then ich komme!</td>', 'THis image gives me a feeling of peace and comfort. If that is what Groningen is all about, then ich komme!', '2003-05-05 23:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(288589, 20501, 6870, '<td valign="top">Composition is wonderful with the emphasis on the peaceful water. I really do wish I were there.</td>', 'Composition is wonderful with the emphasis on the peaceful water. I really do wish I were there.', '2003-05-05 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(288591, 20437, 6870, '<td valign="top">Point of view is wonderful here, and you managed to capture excellent and interesting light, too! The netting is weird, and I do wish I could see the actual statue, but this is a wonderful example of good architectural photography.</td>', 'Point of view is wonderful here, and you managed to capture excellent and interesting light, too! The netting is weird, and I do wish I could see the actual statue, but this is a wonderful example of good architectural photography.', '2003-05-05 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288593, 20521, 6870, '<td valign="top">Count me in! I''m comin''! Wonderful sense of peace and relaxation here! Could the light be any more perfect?</td>', 'Count me in! I''m comin''! Wonderful sense of peace and relaxation here! Could the light be any more perfect?', '2003-05-05 23:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288595, 20335, 6870, '<td valign="top">This certainly makes me want to go to Kalaloch Lodge! LIghting is wonderful, and I like the architectural sillhouetttes, which give a feeling of the lodge itself.</td>', 'This certainly makes me want to go to Kalaloch Lodge! LIghting is wonderful, and I like the architectural sillhouetttes, which give a feeling of the lodge itself.', '2003-05-05 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(288600, 20411, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nearly perfect exposure 7 contrast, sharp focus. Nice sky (polarizer, I presume). The understated text works well for me. An excellent image.<br/>Did you consider any alternative framing/cropping? I don''t know what''s out-of-frame, so I''m hesitant to suggest it could be better...<br/>wish I had this kind of weather for my submission!</td>', 'Nearly perfect exposure 7 contrast, sharp focus. Nice sky (polarizer, I presume). The understated text works well for me. An excellent image.Did you consider any alternative framing/cropping? I don''t know what''s out-of-frame, so I''m hesitant to suggest it could be better...wish I had this kind of weather for my submission!', '2003-05-05 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(288601, 20419, 2333, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus, good exposure. Could benefit from polarizer (darken sky). Sun is in ideal position for maximum polarization effect.<br/>I might have brought in just a bit less sky if adding more foreground would not result in intrusion of unwanted clutter.<br/>All in all, beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful focus, good exposure. Could benefit from polarizer (darken sky). Sun is in ideal position for maximum polarization effect.I might have brought in just a bit less sky if adding more foreground would not result in intrusion of unwanted clutter.All in all, beautiful.', '2003-05-05 23:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288603, 20253, 2333, '<td valign="top">I like the vignette effect; a bit more sepia tone would have been beneficial, of course that''s a matter of opinion!<br/>Could you have emphasized the clouds by adjusting color channels?<br/>Overall, very nice image.</td>', 'I like the vignette effect; a bit more sepia tone would have been beneficial, of course that''s a matter of opinion!Could you have emphasized the clouds by adjusting color channels?Overall, very nice image.', '2003-05-05 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(288604, 20298, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity and ''quiet'' of this shot with the overriding blues and yellows (just put a red object in that field and you''ve got it licked for the primary colors challenge as well :) My only beef is with the dark area in the front. For my taste, the pic would have been stronger if it had started higher with the brighter yellows. Nice font as well. 7</td>', 'Like the simplicity and ''quiet'' of this shot with the overriding blues and yellows (just put a red object in that field and you''ve got it licked for the primary colors challenge as well :) My only beef is with the dark area in the front. For my taste, the pic would have been stronger if it had started higher with the brighter yellows. Nice font as well. 7', '2003-05-05 23:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(288608, 20519, 2333, '<td valign="top">I love the simple lines of this photo. I very much like your choice of poetry.<br/>Three wishes:<br/> - A bit of sky darkening (polarizer)<br/> - Boost the dark tones just a bit to show (just a little more) detail in building shadows<br/> - A bit wider crop, give more of the spacious feeling of the land</td>', 'I love the simple lines of this photo. I very much like your choice of poetry.Three wishes: - A bit of sky darkening (polarizer) - Boost the dark tones just a bit to show (just a little more) detail in building shadows - A bit wider crop, give more of the spacious feeling of the land', '2003-05-05 23:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288610, 20396, 2333, '<td valign="top">Ahh, Bay of Fundy? I visited there briefly last Fall on a motorcycle trip. <br/>I think a bit closer crop on the outcropping (pun intended) would be benificial. Only one opinion though</td>', 'Ahh, Bay of Fundy? I visited there briefly last Fall on a motorcycle trip. I think a bit closer crop on the outcropping (pun intended) would be benificial. Only one opinion though', '2003-05-05 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288611, 20504, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very strong design here; the thumbnail just popped at me. What''s the red notice for? Did someone think you cut &amp; pasted in the background? :) Think you did that deliberately with the polarizer to harmonize the image. Man, this is strong in design! 8</td>', 'Very strong design here; the thumbnail just popped at me. What''s the red notice for? Did someone think you cut & pasted in the background? :) Think you did that deliberately with the polarizer to harmonize the image. Man, this is strong in design! 8', '2003-05-05 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288612, 20268, 2333, '<td valign="top">Are ther eany oranges left in Orange County? ;-)<br/>Nice clean concept. I like the framing. Not quite sure the border works as well as it could, maybe thinner?</td>', 'Are ther eany oranges left in Orange County? ;-)Nice clean concept. I like the framing. Not quite sure the border works as well as it could, maybe thinner?', '2003-05-05 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288614, 20252, 2333, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I traveled thru Sudbury by Motorcycle last Fall, but somehow missed the nickel!</td>', 'Hmmm, I traveled thru Sudbury by Motorcycle last Fall, but somehow missed the nickel!', '2003-05-06 00:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(288620, 20383, 2333, '<td valign="top">Everything works beautifully in this image. Perfect choice of border geometry and color. Wonderful exposure. Kudos.<br/>I visited Stockholm last year, however I did not come away with ny photos this beautiful.</td>', 'Everything works beautifully in this image. Perfect choice of border geometry and color. Wonderful exposure. Kudos.I visited Stockholm last year, however I did not come away with ny photos this beautiful.', '2003-05-06 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(288623, 20518, 2586, '<td valign="top">Great picture! This sums up NY with all its energy much better to me than any picture of a monument (so often seen already). Colors are great, too. 10</td>', 'Great picture! This sums up NY with all its energy much better to me than any picture of a monument (so often seen already). Colors are great, too. 10', '2003-05-06 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(288624, 20370, 2333, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed night shot.</td>', 'Beautifully exposed night shot.', '2003-05-06 00:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288625, 20439, 2333, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, crisp image.<br/>I might have gone for just a very little more contrast and slightly less white border. Very classy.</td>', 'A beautiful, crisp image.I might have gone for just a very little more contrast and slightly less white border. Very classy.', '2003-05-06 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(288626, 20411, 2586, '<td valign="top">Guten Abend. This is postcard-perfect. Nice how one''s eye is led from the grass onto the bridge, right into castle gate and castle. Colors are great (for my taste, i might have knocked down the saturation of the sky just a tad). The only thing that bothers me a little is the shadow on the grass but that might be from a permanent object. 9</td>', 'Guten Abend. This is postcard-perfect. Nice how one''s eye is led from the grass onto the bridge, right into castle gate and castle. Colors are great (for my taste, i might have knocked down the saturation of the sky just a tad). The only thing that bothers me a little is the shadow on the grass but that might be from a permanent object. 9', '2003-05-06 00:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(288627, 20481, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing and exposure. there is a pronounced yellow cast to colors. If others comment on this as well, consider checking your monitor calibration. I''ve been burnt on one of my submissions that I edited on an uncalibrated system!</td>', 'Very nice framing and exposure. there is a pronounced yellow cast to colors. If others comment on this as well, consider checking your monitor calibration. I''ve been burnt on one of my submissions that I edited on an uncalibrated system!', '2003-05-06 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(288629, 20528, 2333, '<td valign="top">Have you offered this design to the hotel?<br/>Only comment for improvement would be keep to the lettering within the black border.</td>', 'Have you offered this design to the hotel?Only comment for improvement would be keep to the lettering within the black border.', '2003-05-06 00:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(288630, 20337, 2333, '<td valign="top">The roof in the foreground is a distraction; there is also a distinct blue cast. I like the framing (sans the roof, but of course easy fo rme to say, not knowing how accessible the area is!)</td>', 'The roof in the foreground is a distraction; there is also a distinct blue cast. I like the framing (sans the roof, but of course easy fo rme to say, not knowing how accessible the area is!)', '2003-05-06 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(288632, 20309, 2333, '<td valign="top">Simply exceptional!</td>', 'Simply exceptional!', '2003-05-06 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(288633, 20417, 2586, '<td valign="top">Really like the originality of this shot. Have never been to Manchester but, judgng from postcard, you make it look a lot more interesting than i ever could imagine. Strong composition, great colors, the text is perfect - bold yet not interfering and matching the boldness of the architecture. Minor nitpick: in the title, shouldn''t there be a comma or a dash after Manchester? This is the type of postcard friends would send to me because they know i don''t care much for the run of the mill typical postcard. 10</td>', 'Really like the originality of this shot. Have never been to Manchester but, judgng from postcard, you make it look a lot more interesting than i ever could imagine. Strong composition, great colors, the text is perfect - bold yet not interfering and matching the boldness of the architecture. Minor nitpick: in the title, shouldn''t there be a comma or a dash after Manchester? This is the type of postcard friends would send to me because they know i don''t care much for the run of the mill typical postcard. 10', '2003-05-06 00:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(288635, 20482, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very unique take on this challenge. Exceptional artistically and technically. Lve the lettering!</td>', 'Very unique take on this challenge. Exceptional artistically and technically. Lve the lettering!', '2003-05-06 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288636, 20518, 2333, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this shot done good &amp; very good, but you''ve set the standard. Kudos.</td>', 'I''ve seen this shot done good & very good, but you''ve set the standard. Kudos.', '2003-05-06 00:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288637, 20383, 2586, '<td valign="top">A very fine image that really speaks and says a lot about this small town. Colors are great, you really sought a good light situation. Initially, i wondered whether the white boat in the foreground shouldn''t have been there but decided it really was an important design element. 9</td>', 'A very fine image that really speaks and says a lot about this small town. Colors are great, you really sought a good light situation. Initially, i wondered whether the white boat in the foreground shouldn''t have been there but decided it really was an important design element. 9', '2003-05-06 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(288638, 20254, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image, nice title, nice placement within the image. My only problem with this image is that i would have liked to see the first rock on the right more in focus (which seems to be on the second rock). That first rock is so blurred that i have some trouble relating to it. 8</td>', 'Nice image, nice title, nice placement within the image. My only problem with this image is that i would have liked to see the first rock on the right more in focus (which seems to be on the second rock). That first rock is so blurred that i have some trouble relating to it. 8', '2003-05-06 00:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288640, 20482, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the image and it reminds me of the Don''t Mess with Texas motto (which is such a great motto). The Texas text fits in well, too. My problem is that it so very much the representation of a work of art, although you cropped it well to its essence. 7</td>', 'Like the image and it reminds me of the Don''t Mess with Texas motto (which is such a great motto). The Texas text fits in well, too. My problem is that it so very much the representation of a work of art, although you cropped it well to its essence. 7', '2003-05-06 00:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(288644, 20253, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, I love the entire look from the slight sepia look to the filter used to obtain the appearance of looking through something.  Makes me feel like I just stepped back to the about 1910.</td>', 'Very interesting image, I love the entire look from the slight sepia look to the filter used to obtain the appearance of looking through something.  Makes me feel like I just stepped back to the about 1910.', '2003-05-06 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(288648, 20335, 2586, '<td valign="top">I would never buy any postcard that has a spelling error on it.</td>', 'I would never buy any postcard that has a spelling error on it.', '2003-05-06 00:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288656, 20449, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love how the text almost looks as if it were writen in the water. The boat adds a touristy element; I''d rather look at this marvelous scenery that you''ve captured so well.</td>', 'I love how the text almost looks as if it were writen in the water. The boat adds a touristy element; I''d rather look at this marvelous scenery that you''ve captured so well.', '2003-05-06 01:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(288657, 20298, 6870, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me want to go there! Lovely tones and colors! Composition is flawless. The sky is a little pale, but wow! what an image!</td>', 'This photo makes me want to go there! Lovely tones and colors! Composition is flawless. The sky is a little pale, but wow! what an image!', '2003-05-06 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(288658, 20112, 6870, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of contrasts here--it all seems the same tone throughout. But the composition is excellent, and I love how the trees frame the lighthouse.</td>', 'Not a lot of contrasts here--it all seems the same tone throughout. But the composition is excellent, and I love how the trees frame the lighthouse.', '2003-05-06 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288659, 20414, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of water. The text seems to add a sense of the area, as it is so stylized. Good composition. Lowering your point of view would eliminate the electric lines and pole.</td>', 'Very nice shot of water. The text seems to add a sense of the area, as it is so stylized. Good composition. Lowering your point of view would eliminate the electric lines and pole.', '2003-05-06 01:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(288660, 20262, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset. The use of line is really nice here. Of course, I want to go there! But I don''t know where this is.</td>', 'Lovely sunset. The use of line is really nice here. Of course, I want to go there! But I don''t know where this is.', '2003-05-06 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(288664, 20375, 6870, '<td valign="top">I know how colors in this desert can be! You may have overdone the saturation, but I love it anyway. Very nice composition and point of view. Makes for an engaging and interesting shot.</td>', 'I know how colors in this desert can be! You may have overdone the saturation, but I love it anyway. Very nice composition and point of view. Makes for an engaging and interesting shot.', '2003-05-06 01:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(288665, 20399, 6870, '<td valign="top">I would assume that this tree bespeaks the essence of Bellingham? It is nicely placed in the composition, though I wish your colors everywhere were a tad richer.</td>', 'I would assume that this tree bespeaks the essence of Bellingham? It is nicely placed in the composition, though I wish your colors everywhere were a tad richer.', '2003-05-06 01:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288667, 20435, 6870, '<td valign="top">I can''t resist a cactus shot! Nice bloom! I like the DOF, but the blooms themselves (and the moth) seem slighly out of focus. Very lovely composition and lighting. The soft semi circle makes for a nice line over which my eye can go again and again.</td>', 'I can''t resist a cactus shot! Nice bloom! I like the DOF, but the blooms themselves (and the moth) seem slighly out of focus. Very lovely composition and lighting. The soft semi circle makes for a nice line over which my eye can go again and again.', '2003-05-06 01:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(288669, 20395, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts and sky here. The falls are pretty too. The composition is great and focus works for this shot. The lighting is a bit harsh, but you capture the power of these falls.</td>', 'Nice contrasts and sky here. The falls are pretty too. The composition is great and focus works for this shot. The lighting is a bit harsh, but you capture the power of these falls.', '2003-05-06 01:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288691, 20336, 5318, '<td valign="top">awsome pic man thats a 10 beeautiful!!!!!</td>', 'awsome pic man thats a 10 beeautiful!!!!!', '2003-05-06 02:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(288701, 20384, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful location but the focus is a bit soft or maybe camera shake and the image is a little dark. Very nice composition. Good Job.</td>', 'Very beautiful location but the focus is a bit soft or maybe camera shake and the image is a little dark. Very nice composition. Good Job.', '2003-05-06 03:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288703, 20363, 1135, '<td valign="top">I like the composition/perspective and the tree is beautiful. Too bad the sky is just white.</td>', 'I like the composition/perspective and the tree is beautiful. Too bad the sky is just white.', '2003-05-06 03:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(288705, 20411, 1135, '<td valign="top">Okay I would buy this postcard. 10</td>', 'Okay I would buy this postcard. 10', '2003-05-06 03:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288706, 20481, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The only thing I would do is pump up the blue in the sky a bit. 8</td>', 'Very nice. The only thing I would do is pump up the blue in the sky a bit. 8', '2003-05-06 03:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(288708, 20332, 1135, '<td valign="top">You only used 400 of your available 620 pixels, bigger is better. Great color!</td>', 'You only used 400 of your available 620 pixels, bigger is better. Great color!', '2003-05-06 03:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(288709, 20268, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The meat of the orange is a little dark and the slice is a little too bright. Overall a nice postcard and I can almost smell it. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice image. The meat of the orange is a little dark and the slice is a little too bright. Overall a nice postcard and I can almost smell it. Good Job.', '2003-05-06 03:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(288711, 20269, 1135, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and your font looks very professional. 9</td>', 'Excellent shot and your font looks very professional. 9', '2003-05-06 03:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(288714, 20364, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice color and great composition but I think the crop is a little too tight. I would like to see more of the boat. 7</td>', 'Nice color and great composition but I think the crop is a little too tight. I would like to see more of the boat. 7', '2003-05-06 03:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(288716, 20370, 1135, '<td valign="top">Great job. Maybe a little tight on the crop, a little more sky above the tower would help. Still a great shot. 9</td>', 'Great job. Maybe a little tight on the crop, a little more sky above the tower would help. Still a great shot. 9', '2003-05-06 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(288718, 20414, 1135, '<td valign="top">The power line is a problem but then if this was a real postcard you would just edit it out. Maybe you could have shot this from the other side?</td>', 'The power line is a problem but then if this was a real postcard you would just edit it out. Maybe you could have shot this from the other side?', '2003-05-06 03:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(288719, 20399, 1135, '<td valign="top">I would have had the tree just a little more off center otherwise this is great. 6</td>', 'I would have had the tree just a little more off center otherwise this is great. 6', '2003-05-06 03:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(288722, 20457, 1135, '<td valign="top">The horizon is tilted just a little to the left and the shadow on the people is distracting, maybe because they are the main subject based on the rule of thirds. If you could have gotten the hot babe in the foreground to pose, and made her the subject this shot wound have been even better. Nice Job.</td>', 'The horizon is tilted just a little to the left and the shadow on the people is distracting, maybe because they are the main subject based on the rule of thirds. If you could have gotten the hot babe in the foreground to pose, and made her the subject this shot wound have been even better. Nice Job.', '2003-05-06 03:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288743, 20446, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very serene feeling to it. What a coincidence the flowers are the same color as the roof, it adds an effective touch to it. The darker area and the twig at the bottom of the image give me the impression you were shooting out of the woods, or laying on the ground so as not to scare the horse. Sniper tactics! Ummmm - 9.</td>', 'This photo has a very serene feeling to it. What a coincidence the flowers are the same color as the roof, it adds an effective touch to it. The darker area and the twig at the bottom of the image give me the impression you were shooting out of the woods, or laying on the ground so as not to scare the horse. Sniper tactics! Ummmm - 9.', '2003-05-06 05:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(288746, 20543, 5728, '<td valign="top">That is a very impressive building and you''ve managed to get everything in your image in focus. The trees are stopping you from capturing a full view of the museum but there isn''t too much you can do about that unless you got up on a crane or something. It is a very good postcard shot, and that blue sky works as an excellent background for the yellowy color of the building.</td>', 'That is a very impressive building and you''ve managed to get everything in your image in focus. The trees are stopping you from capturing a full view of the museum but there isn''t too much you can do about that unless you got up on a crane or something. It is a very good postcard shot, and that blue sky works as an excellent background for the yellowy color of the building.', '2003-05-06 05:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(288748, 19823, 5728, '<td valign="top">That really is the kind of writing and text I would expect to find on a postcard, good idea! The perspective of your photo is very good although I would have tried to get up higher somehow, maybe stand on the car roof or something, to get more above that bush in the foreground.</td>', 'That really is the kind of writing and text I would expect to find on a postcard, good idea! The perspective of your photo is very good although I would have tried to get up higher somehow, maybe stand on the car roof or something, to get more above that bush in the foreground.', '2003-05-06 05:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(288751, 20356, 5728, '<td valign="top">You do live in the right place don''t you! We have no waterfalls anywhere near here. Your choice of scene for your postcard is excellent, no doubt about that. It is the kind of image I would see on postcards. The only problem with this is that you have blurred out the waterfall, which is your main subject according to the title. A very small aperture would have taken care of that.</td>', 'You do live in the right place don''t you! We have no waterfalls anywhere near here. Your choice of scene for your postcard is excellent, no doubt about that. It is the kind of image I would see on postcards. The only problem with this is that you have blurred out the waterfall, which is your main subject according to the title. A very small aperture would have taken care of that.', '2003-05-06 05:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(288753, 20168, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, the blue tones work well here. This image would have placed high in the perspective challenge. As a postcard it is a good choice.</td>', 'This is good, the blue tones work well here. This image would have placed high in the perspective challenge. As a postcard it is a good choice.', '2003-05-06 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(288754, 20335, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The natural framing is a good idea and the golden colors of the sunset always works for postcard shots.</td>', 'Beautiful! The natural framing is a good idea and the golden colors of the sunset always works for postcard shots.', '2003-05-06 05:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288756, 20112, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the old-fashioned feeling you are creating with your postcard especially with the nostalgic kind of writing. The colors you have brought out also convey to me a sense of the past. Very good!</td>', 'I like the old-fashioned feeling you are creating with your postcard especially with the nostalgic kind of writing. The colors you have brought out also convey to me a sense of the past. Very good!', '2003-05-06 05:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(288758, 20386, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Not much to critique on here. The colors are good, the cloud formation in the sky boosts this pic as opposed to a clear cloudless blue sky. The composition is bang on, well done.</td>', 'Good shot! Not much to critique on here. The colors are good, the cloud formation in the sky boosts this pic as opposed to a clear cloudless blue sky. The composition is bang on, well done.', '2003-05-06 05:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288759, 20368, 3900, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pic of a ferry, but I don''t get the title.  Where is the island?</td>', 'This is a nice pic of a ferry, but I don''t get the title.  Where is the island?', '2003-05-06 05:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(288761, 20439, 3900, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I would like to send one of these to my mother if I visited Toronto.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I would like to send one of these to my mother if I visited Toronto.', '2003-05-06 05:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(288763, 20434, 3900, '<td valign="top">Love the colorful houses; very nice card.</td>', 'Love the colorful houses; very nice card.', '2003-05-06 05:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(288765, 20448, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea! I like how you have contrasted the layering effect of sky, clouds and land with the vertical column of steam. The sky is a deep crispy blue, and the further up you look the bluer it gets, well done. The text? Well that''s a matter of personal opinion, for me it is a little too big and is distracting from the photo.</td>', 'Good idea! I like how you have contrasted the layering effect of sky, clouds and land with the vertical column of steam. The sky is a deep crispy blue, and the further up you look the bluer it gets, well done. The text? Well that''s a matter of personal opinion, for me it is a little too big and is distracting from the photo.', '2003-05-06 05:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(288766, 20270, 3900, '<td valign="top">The text and the box are really lost here for me, and the Pegasus sign is partially obstructed by the buildings.  You really need a better angle and maybe a solid frame.</td>', 'The text and the box are really lost here for me, and the Pegasus sign is partially obstructed by the buildings.  You really need a better angle and maybe a solid frame.', '2003-05-06 05:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288769, 20518, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hey, great action shot to depict a very busy city.  The dimensions might be a little tall for post card though.  Maybe just chop off a bit of the top.</td>', 'Hey, great action shot to depict a very busy city.  The dimensions might be a little tall for post card though.  Maybe just chop off a bit of the top.', '2003-05-06 06:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(288771, 20434, 5728, '<td valign="top">Typical postcard shot. You caught the perspective wonderfully. The colors have come out very crisp and inviting. The only thing that would have made this even better would have been a deep blue sky but I guess you couldn''t have done anything about that right?</td>', 'Typical postcard shot. You caught the perspective wonderfully. The colors have come out very crisp and inviting. The only thing that would have made this even better would have been a deep blue sky but I guess you couldn''t have done anything about that right?', '2003-05-06 06:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(288772, 20422, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but it doesn''t really look like a postcard; more like a plea or protest.</td>', 'Nice colors, but it doesn''t really look like a postcard; more like a plea or protest.', '2003-05-06 06:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(288773, 20322, 3900, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too wide in dimension for a postcard, and looks like it could use some levels adjustment to get rid of that hazy look and bring out the colors.</td>', 'Looks a little too wide in dimension for a postcard, and looks like it could use some levels adjustment to get rid of that hazy look and bring out the colors.', '2003-05-06 06:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(288777, 20138, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this was either early moring or early evening right? Good capture, very typical postcard-like. It almost seems like a panorama shot. It would have been perfect without those clouds there and a crisp blue sky, but the weather is just luck right?</td>', 'Now this was either early moring or early evening right? Good capture, very typical postcard-like. It almost seems like a panorama shot. It would have been perfect without those clouds there and a crisp blue sky, but the weather is just luck right?', '2003-05-06 06:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(288779, 20506, 3900, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice soft feel to it and makes me want to be there.  The only thing is that it seems to be tilted to the left a bit.</td>', 'This has a really nice soft feel to it and makes me want to be there.  The only thing is that it seems to be tilted to the left a bit.', '2003-05-06 06:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(288780, 20525, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen cows/bulls like that before, those horns almost look unnatural! Good capture, maybe just a little too tightly cropped tho, but still a postcard shot.</td>', 'I''ve never seen cows/bulls like that before, those horns almost look unnatural! Good capture, maybe just a little too tightly cropped tho, but still a postcard shot.', '2003-05-06 06:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288781, 20356, 3900, '<td valign="top">Really nice, but I wish the "Land of 1000 Waterfalls" postcard would be focussed on the waterfall itself.</td>', 'Really nice, but I wish the "Land of 1000 Waterfalls" postcard would be focussed on the waterfall itself.', '2003-05-06 06:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288784, 20454, 3900, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title.  Is this a photo of a postcard?  Well, whatever, I wish the large text wasn''t there.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title.  Is this a photo of a postcard?  Well, whatever, I wish the large text wasn''t there.', '2003-05-06 06:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(288786, 20395, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lucky you living in a place like this! That water is amazing! The crispy dark blue sky is an added bonus here, an excellent capture and perfect postcard shot. The only thing is that it appears a little over softened to me, did you use NeatImage on this?</td>', 'Lucky you living in a place like this! That water is amazing! The crispy dark blue sky is an added bonus here, an excellent capture and perfect postcard shot. The only thing is that it appears a little over softened to me, did you use NeatImage on this?', '2003-05-06 06:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(288788, 20504, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great new and old shot, however I wish I could get a better sense of the perspective and size differences of the two buildings, since they are so far apart.</td>', 'Great new and old shot, however I wish I could get a better sense of the perspective and size differences of the two buildings, since they are so far apart.', '2003-05-06 06:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(288789, 20417, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the concept you have chosen here, the perspective is very good. Maybe a little too much contrast between light and shadows but generally a top postcard image.</td>', 'I like the concept you have chosen here, the perspective is very good. Maybe a little too much contrast between light and shadows but generally a top postcard image.', '2003-05-06 06:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288791, 20240, 3900, '<td valign="top">A good seaside depiction, but I would straighten out the horizon and lose the grainyness.</td>', 'A good seaside depiction, but I would straighten out the horizon and lose the grainyness.', '2003-05-06 06:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288793, 20161, 3900, '<td valign="top">This is a great historical attraction shot.  But I''m afraid the text is almost lost; very hard to read for me.  Maybe white or some lighter color, or put it on a larger border off of the pic.</td>', 'This is a great historical attraction shot.  But I''m afraid the text is almost lost; very hard to read for me.  Maybe white or some lighter color, or put it on a larger border off of the pic.', '2003-05-06 06:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(288796, 20252, 3900, '<td valign="top">That''s a good photo, but what is it really?  It doesn''t look like any nickel I''ve ever seen.  Is it just a sign for a park?  I can''t read Latin.</td>', 'That''s a good photo, but what is it really?  It doesn''t look like any nickel I''ve ever seen.  Is it just a sign for a park?  I can''t read Latin.', '2003-05-06 06:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(288797, 20209, 3900, '<td valign="top">Very nice nature shot here, but I think it could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Very nice nature shot here, but I think it could be a bit sharper.', '2003-05-06 06:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(288802, 20535, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s really cool; it looks like a flag.  If only the whole thing were a bit sharper.</td>', 'Hey, that''s really cool; it looks like a flag.  If only the whole thing were a bit sharper.', '2003-05-06 06:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
