(288810, 20497, 3084, '<td valign="top">Oh Canada!<br/> <br/>Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  Wonderful architecture, but I thought that this building was in Hull?  Morgan</td>', 'Oh Canada! Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  Wonderful architecture, but I thought that this building was in Hull?  Morgan', '2003-05-06 06:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(288811, 20503, 3084, '<td valign="top">Oh Canada!<br/> <br/>Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  Morgan</td>', 'Oh Canada! Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  Morgan', '2003-05-06 06:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(288812, 20514, 3900, '<td valign="top">I feel I have to be brutally honest here and say that I really hate the text, although I do appreciate the attempt at originality.  Also, it looks like you did some processing that made the trees really fuzzy and not natural-looking.  I hope to visit Billings some day, but I''m afraid this postcard won''t help draw me there.</td>', 'I feel I have to be brutally honest here and say that I really hate the text, although I do appreciate the attempt at originality.  Also, it looks like you did some processing that made the trees really fuzzy and not natural-looking.  I hope to visit Billings some day, but I''m afraid this postcard won''t help draw me there.', '2003-05-06 06:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(288813, 20439, 3084, '<td valign="top">Oh Canada!<br/> <br/>Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  I love Hanlan''s and have spent hundreds of nights on the wall in Blockhouse Bay.  Where was this taken from, the Island Yacht Club tender?  Also, when was it taken? The water seems pretty low for springtime.  Morgan</td>', 'Oh Canada! Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  I love Hanlan''s and have spent hundreds of nights on the wall in Blockhouse Bay.  Where was this taken from, the Island Yacht Club tender?  Also, when was it taken? The water seems pretty low for springtime.  Morgan', '2003-05-06 06:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(288814, 20337, 3084, '<td valign="top">Oh Canada!<br/> <br/>Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  I love St. John''s and the Avalon too.  My mother is a Walsh from up the shore in Feurmuse.  Morgan</td>', 'Oh Canada! Great job, so a great grade of 10 from one Canadian to another.  Good luck in the challenge.  I love St. John''s and the Avalon too.  My mother is a Walsh from up the shore in Feurmuse.  Morgan', '2003-05-06 06:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288815, 20518, 3084, '<td valign="top">The very best image of the challenge.  You should win if it was up to me.  Great job.  10  Morgan</td>', 'The very best image of the challenge.  You should win if it was up to me.  Great job.  10  Morgan', '2003-05-06 06:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(288816, 20269, 3900, '<td valign="top">I really like how you placed the tall building and I like the transparent border.  The text works well also.  The only bad thing I can see is the lower shadows on the buildings to the left, but that is nitpicking.  GREAT postcard!!!</td>', 'I really like how you placed the tall building and I like the transparent border.  The text works well also.  The only bad thing I can see is the lower shadows on the buildings to the left, but that is nitpicking.  GREAT postcard!!!', '2003-05-06 06:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(288817, 20481, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good postcard shot. The green tones come through well. This would have looked awesome if you had used a polarizer filter to bring out the blues of the sky.</td>', 'Good postcard shot. The green tones come through well. This would have looked awesome if you had used a polarizer filter to bring out the blues of the sky.', '2003-05-06 07:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(288819, 20516, 3900, '<td valign="top">I must be brutally honest here.  I hate the text color and font; it''s just gaudy.  And the framing of this pic needs to pull back and show the whole building, or move to a different perspective.</td>', 'I must be brutally honest here.  I hate the text color and font; it''s just gaudy.  And the framing of this pic needs to pull back and show the whole building, or move to a different perspective.', '2003-05-06 07:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(288820, 20331, 5728, '<td valign="top">This has a very nice soft feel to it which you often find in postcard shots. The only thing I would have changed is the sun''s position. I would have cropped it into one of the third''s positions to bring in more impact. The colors are amazing here.</td>', 'This has a very nice soft feel to it which you often find in postcard shots. The only thing I would have changed is the sun''s position. I would have cropped it into one of the third''s positions to bring in more impact. The colors are amazing here.', '2003-05-06 07:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(288821, 20511, 3900, '<td valign="top">This is a great macro, but i fail to comprehend how it can be a postcard.</td>', 'This is a great macro, but i fail to comprehend how it can be a postcard.', '2003-05-06 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(288822, 20111, 5728, '<td valign="top">The structures contrast well against the blue sky. You have chosen an unusual perspective here but the title explains to me what you are getting at. Good deep DOF, everything is in focus, well done.</td>', 'The structures contrast well against the blue sky. You have chosen an unusual perspective here but the title explains to me what you are getting at. Good deep DOF, everything is in focus, well done.', '2003-05-06 07:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288824, 20442, 3900, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I don''t like how the text falls below the pic for most of the lowercase letters and goes above for others.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I don''t like how the text falls below the pic for most of the lowercase letters and goes above for others.', '2003-05-06 07:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(288825, 20519, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea to put in a quote, the only one in the challenge I''ve seen, well done. This is the kind of postcard shot I would expect to find from Iceland, and yep, I''d buy it too. I particularly like the way you shot from the ground up.</td>', 'Good idea to put in a quote, the only one in the challenge I''ve seen, well done. This is the kind of postcard shot I would expect to find from Iceland, and yep, I''d buy it too. I particularly like the way you shot from the ground up.', '2003-05-06 07:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(288826, 20396, 3900, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but the title eludes me completely.</td>', 'Nice pic, but the title eludes me completely.', '2003-05-06 07:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(288827, 20456, 5728, '<td valign="top">When I looked at the thumbnail I thought those flowers in the foreground were crowds of people :-). This is a typical postcard shot, I like it. It would have looked amazing had you used a polarizer filter to bring out the sky and clouds more.</td>', 'When I looked at the thumbnail I thought those flowers in the foreground were crowds of people :-). This is a typical postcard shot, I like it. It would have looked amazing had you used a polarizer filter to bring out the sky and clouds more.', '2003-05-06 07:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288829, 20516, 5728, '<td valign="top">I have heard a lot about this place but never actually seen what it looks like. Now I know thank you. You have taken this pic from a very good perspective and cropped it well. What a pity you didn''t have blues skies to make this a perfect shot! But you can''t control the weather I guess, I like it anyway :-)</td>', 'I have heard a lot about this place but never actually seen what it looks like. Now I know thank you. You have taken this pic from a very good perspective and cropped it well. What a pity you didn''t have blues skies to make this a perfect shot! But you can''t control the weather I guess, I like it anyway :-)', '2003-05-06 07:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288830, 20482, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good! There aren''t too many postcards in this challenge with humor. This one is humorous and I like how you have composed it. Nice color, contrast and detail. You got my thumbs up here!</td>', 'This is good! There aren''t too many postcards in this challenge with humor. This one is humorous and I like how you have composed it. Nice color, contrast and detail. You got my thumbs up here!', '2003-05-06 07:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(288831, 20383, 3900, '<td valign="top">Very nice ...I want to visit here.  Great lighting and color... text works well.</td>', 'Very nice ...I want to visit here.  Great lighting and color... text works well.', '2003-05-06 07:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(288832, 20253, 3900, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I''m wondering what "Looking Back" means for a postcard.</td>', 'Good shot, but I''m wondering what "Looking Back" means for a postcard.', '2003-05-06 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(288833, 20268, 3900, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I feel the border detracts from it.</td>', 'I like the photo, but I feel the border detracts from it.', '2003-05-06 07:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288834, 20440, 3900, '<td valign="top">To be brutally honest, the text color is horrid, and I''m not attracted to a photo of the Civic Center, although the pic is not bad, but it looks a bit over-processed and fuzzy.</td>', 'To be brutally honest, the text color is horrid, and I''m not attracted to a photo of the Civic Center, although the pic is not bad, but it looks a bit over-processed and fuzzy.', '2003-05-06 07:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(288835, 20456, 3900, '<td valign="top">Really nice pic, but too much text.</td>', 'Really nice pic, but too much text.', '2003-05-06 07:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(288836, 20336, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great photo ... where is this?</td>', 'Great photo ... where is this?', '2003-05-06 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(288837, 20252, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is a typical postcard shot, you''re on the right track here! You were lucky getting that crispy blue sky with amazing cloud formations in the background to increase the quality of you pic! I particularly like the perspective you chose for this.</td>', 'Now this is a typical postcard shot, you''re on the right track here! You were lucky getting that crispy blue sky with amazing cloud formations in the background to increase the quality of you pic! I particularly like the perspective you chose for this.', '2003-05-06 07:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(288838, 20454, 5728, '<td valign="top">It really does resemble a painted photo. I really like the position you chose to take this pic, the composition is awesome.The stormy sky out the back breaks up the dominant brown color perfectly. You can be proud of this photo. What is bothersome to me is the "Wish you were here" text. Personally I would have left it out completely. Or if you really wanted it to be included I would have placed it in the lower lefthand corner.</td>', 'It really does resemble a painted photo. I really like the position you chose to take this pic, the composition is awesome.The stormy sky out the back breaks up the dominant brown color perfectly. You can be proud of this photo. What is bothersome to me is the "Wish you were here" text. Personally I would have left it out completely. Or if you really wanted it to be included I would have placed it in the lower lefthand corner.', '2003-05-06 07:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(288839, 20414, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good nature shot, wild water and rocks; typical postcard. However, some of the naturalness of the photo is decreased by the inclusion of the power pole and lines in the background. Maybe it would have been impossible to take this shot without that background but I''m sure a slight change in your position could have excluded the powerpole on the right hand side. Other than that, a top image.</td>', 'This is a good nature shot, wild water and rocks; typical postcard. However, some of the naturalness of the photo is decreased by the inclusion of the power pole and lines in the background. Maybe it would have been impossible to take this shot without that background but I''m sure a slight change in your position could have excluded the powerpole on the right hand side. Other than that, a top image.', '2003-05-06 07:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(288846, 20419, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good shot but its spoilt by the sky</td>', 'Good shot but its spoilt by the sky', '2003-05-06 08:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(288848, 19823, 7889, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but i think you should have cropped out the mast which spoils it</td>', 'Nice shot but i think you should have cropped out the mast which spoils it', '2003-05-06 08:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(288851, 20268, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good composition</td>', 'Good idea and good composition', '2003-05-06 08:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(288852, 20309, 7889, '<td valign="top">Foreground is a bit messy</td>', 'Foreground is a bit messy', '2003-05-06 08:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(288853, 20439, 7889, '<td valign="top">Yeh  - this is good - just what a postcard should look like</td>', 'Yeh  - this is good - just what a postcard should look like', '2003-05-06 08:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(288854, 20482, 7889, '<td valign="top">Unusual - the bottom left of the photo disracts me a little but a very good ''card</td>', 'Unusual - the bottom left of the photo disracts me a little but a very good ''card', '2003-05-06 08:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288855, 20370, 7889, '<td valign="top">i would buy a postcard like this -</td>', 'i would buy a postcard like this -', '2003-05-06 08:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(288863, 20511, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but i cant see what it has to do with postcards? Good look anyway</td>', 'I like the photo but i cant see what it has to do with postcards? Good look anyway', '2003-05-06 08:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(288869, 20444, 8495, '<td valign="top">I see no fun, only a railroad track?</td>', 'I see no fun, only a railroad track?', '2003-05-06 09:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288901, 20399, 5728, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like summer there! This is a prettty decent postcard pic, everything''s in focus and the writing fits in well and doesn''t distract the eye at all. Personally I wouldn''t have centered the tree as much as you have though. The decision to crop the tree like you have was a good idea.</td>', 'It almost looks like summer there! This is a prettty decent postcard pic, everything''s in focus and the writing fits in well and doesn''t distract the eye at all. Personally I wouldn''t have centered the tree as much as you have though. The decision to crop the tree like you have was a good idea.', '2003-05-06 09:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(288906, 20501, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks very inviting there. The sun light off the water gives this image a dreamy hoilday kind of effect. Shooting against the sun has darkened the whole photo somewhat but I don''t think that is negative at all. If you hadn''t mentioned that this is New York I would never have guessed it! Well done.</td>', 'Looks very inviting there. The sun light off the water gives this image a dreamy hoilday kind of effect. Shooting against the sun has darkened the whole photo somewhat but I don''t think that is negative at all. If you hadn''t mentioned that this is New York I would never have guessed it! Well done.', '2003-05-06 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(288922, 20210, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful scenery :)<br/>I like the different blues in the sea combined<br/>with the green in the foreground.<br/>Well done</td>', 'beautiful scenery :)I like the different blues in the sea combinedwith the green in the foreground.Well done', '2003-05-06 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288924, 20269, 7474, '<td valign="top">now that''s a postcard :) Really beautiful work.<br/></td>', 'now that''s a postcard :) Really beautiful work.', '2003-05-06 10:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(288927, 20309, 7474, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the stones<br/>and wood in the foreground. Gives it<br/>an extra point of interest and leads then to the beautiful lighthouse.<br/>beautiful work on this :)</td>', 'I like how you included the stonesand wood in the foreground. Gives itan extra point of interest and leads then to the beautiful lighthouse.beautiful work on this :)', '2003-05-06 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288943, 20405, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah Tecklenburg! What a quaint little village :-)</td>', 'Ah Tecklenburg! What a quaint little village :-)', '2003-05-06 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(288944, 20523, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the natural framing. The composition is good, the text doesn''t distract from the main image, and on top of all that you caught yourself a nice sunny day too.</td>', 'Good idea with the natural framing. The composition is good, the text doesn''t distract from the main image, and on top of all that you caught yourself a nice sunny day too.', '2003-05-06 10:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(288946, 20351, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I''ve seen far too many landscapes and cityscapes and not many of much else.  The color combination is good, yellows and reds. It works well.</td>', 'Good idea, I''ve seen far too many landscapes and cityscapes and not many of much else.  The color combination is good, yellows and reds. It works well.', '2003-05-06 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(288951, 20435, 7765, '<td valign="top">Verrry nice.</td>', 'Verrry nice.', '2003-05-06 10:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(288953, 20382, 5728, '<td valign="top">The play of light and shadows is very interesting here. The black and white effect is also good highlighting those greens more. Personally I would have tried to find a position where you either wouldn''t have the trees on each side, or used them as some kind of natural framing for your image.</td>', 'The play of light and shadows is very interesting here. The black and white effect is also good highlighting those greens more. Personally I would have tried to find a position where you either wouldn''t have the trees on each side, or used them as some kind of natural framing for your image.', '2003-05-06 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(288961, 20478, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image, the effect of the prolonged shutter speed is bang on. Very idyllic and inviting. The kind of photo I would expect to find on a postcard promoting the area you live in. However, I personally find the texting you have chosen doesn''t fit to this image.</td>', 'This is an excellent image, the effect of the prolonged shutter speed is bang on. Very idyllic and inviting. The kind of photo I would expect to find on a postcard promoting the area you live in. However, I personally find the texting you have chosen doesn''t fit to this image.', '2003-05-06 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(288972, 20456, 2923, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or is the horizon slightly off?  Anyway, nice details :-)</td>', 'Is it just me or is the horizon slightly off?  Anyway, nice details :-)', '2003-05-06 11:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(288984, 20519, 5112, '<td valign="top">Your entry made me look up Jónas Hallgrimsson on the net, and I read just a bit of his poetry - it\\\''s very descriptive, it makes you see places; kind of like your postcard, very beautiful, tastefully done.  I hope you do well.  ~9<br/>PS - in your title, if you meant to say the plural of \"house\", it\''s spelled \"houses\".  \"House\''s\" is a possessive, so you\''d have to say something afterwards, such as, \"The old house\''s windowframes are painted white.\"</td>', 'Your entry made me look up Jónas Hallgrimsson on the net, and I read just a bit of his poetry - it\\\''s very descriptive, it makes you see places; kind of like your postcard, very beautiful, tastefully done.  I hope you do well.  ~9PS - in your title, if you meant to say the plural of \"house\", it\''s spelled \"houses\".  \"House\''s\" is a possessive, so you\''d have to say something afterwards, such as, \"The old house\''s windowframes are painted white.\"', '2003-05-06 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(289013, 20384, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ahhh Australia! Now this is a good composition. Mind you I wouldn''t have gotten as close to the edge as you did there! It would have been good to see those greens brought out a bit more, but I guess that is difficult without the sun shining.  And you can''t do anything to change the weather right? It is a typical postcard shot, yep!</td>', 'Ahhh Australia! Now this is a good composition. Mind you I wouldn''t have gotten as close to the edge as you did there! It would have been good to see those greens brought out a bit more, but I guess that is difficult without the sun shining.  And you can''t do anything to change the weather right? It is a typical postcard shot, yep!', '2003-05-06 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(289020, 20419, 7639, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I was there when a flag pole painter fell to his death.</td>', 'Great shot.  I was there when a flag pole painter fell to his death.', '2003-05-06 11:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(289030, 20382, 7639, '<td valign="top">Crazy!</td>', 'Crazy!', '2003-05-06 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(289035, 20161, 7639, '<td valign="top">You took pains to get a good vantage spot.</td>', 'You took pains to get a good vantage spot.', '2003-05-06 11:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(289040, 20331, 7639, '<td valign="top">There goes the rule, "Never aim your camera at the sun!"</td>', 'There goes the rule, "Never aim your camera at the sun!"', '2003-05-06 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(289048, 20511, 7639, '<td valign="top">Then why do my pampered plants die?</td>', 'Then why do my pampered plants die?', '2003-05-06 11:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
