(289697, 20368, 5007, '<td valign="top">Great job of shooting the ferry. I''ve tried and tried to get a good photo but despair that the sun will never shine when I''m there with camera. I take the Kingston Ferry every week.</td>', 'Great job of shooting the ferry. I''ve tried and tried to get a good photo but despair that the sun will never shine when I''m there with camera. I take the Kingston Ferry every week.', '2003-05-06 23:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
