(289699, 20417, 5007, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, lines and composition of this photo. I don''t understand the meaning of the phrase "so much to answer for" but it doesn''t detract from the photo. This would make a great postcard.</td>', 'I love the colors, lines and composition of this photo. I don''t understand the meaning of the phrase "so much to answer for" but it doesn''t detract from the photo. This would make a great postcard.', '2003-05-06 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(289700, 20268, 5007, '<td valign="top">Well done! I can almost smell the oranges.</td>', 'Well done! I can almost smell the oranges.', '2003-05-06 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(289701, 19993, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like how you incorporated the sign into the postcard... no need to add text. Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'I like how you incorporated the sign into the postcard... no need to add text. Nice colors and composition.', '2003-05-06 23:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(289702, 20442, 5007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful beach. You did a nice job of composing this photo as it is beautiful in its simplicity.</td>', 'Beautiful beach. You did a nice job of composing this photo as it is beautiful in its simplicity.', '2003-05-06 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(289703, 20424, 5007, '<td valign="top">What a great comical postcard! Concrete cows.. what will they think of next?</td>', 'What a great comical postcard! Concrete cows.. what will they think of next?', '2003-05-06 23:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(289704, 20253, 5007, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo for its composition. The tone matches the subject. Well done.</td>', 'I really liked this photo for its composition. The tone matches the subject. Well done.', '2003-05-06 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(289705, 20384, 5007, '<td valign="top">What an interesting formation. Makes a great postcard. What I like is the pleasing V shape of the rock. I might have cropped out some of the sky as it doesn''t add a lot to the photo.</td>', 'What an interesting formation. Makes a great postcard. What I like is the pleasing V shape of the rock. I might have cropped out some of the sky as it doesn''t add a lot to the photo.', '2003-05-06 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(289706, 20419, 5007, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the lush green of the foliage and the stately presence of the buildings. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow! I love the lush green of the foliage and the stately presence of the buildings. Nice job.', '2003-05-06 23:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(289707, 20411, 5007, '<td valign="top">A very flattering photograph of this castle.</td>', 'A very flattering photograph of this castle.', '2003-05-06 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(289709, 20254, 5007, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Nice job.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Nice job.', '2003-05-06 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(289711, 20383, 5007, '<td valign="top">This photo tells a story, makes you wonder what is behind the windows. Nice job of composing the photo and good use of light.</td>', 'This photo tells a story, makes you wonder what is behind the windows. Nice job of composing the photo and good use of light.', '2003-05-06 23:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(289712, 20435, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro and the butterfly adds a lot.</td>', 'Very nice macro and the butterfly adds a lot.', '2003-05-06 23:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(289713, 20428, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the sepia tone works well here.</td>', 'Nice shot, the sepia tone works well here.', '2003-05-06 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(289714, 20422, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it is colorful, nicely composed and an interesting subject.</td>', 'I like this photo, it is colorful, nicely composed and an interesting subject.', '2003-05-06 23:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(289720, 20168, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective.  Also like the two tones of blue.  DOF is lost on the upper section though.  I love St Louis!</td>', 'Very interesting perspective.  Also like the two tones of blue.  DOF is lost on the upper section though.  I love St Louis!', '2003-05-06 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(289721, 20525, 6667, '<td valign="top">How  about focusing oon just one for the shot?</td>', 'How  about focusing oon just one for the shot?', '2003-05-06 23:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(289724, 20356, 6667, '<td valign="top">Waterfall should have been the focus then.</td>', 'Waterfall should have been the focus then.', '2003-05-06 23:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(289741, 20168, 8084, '<td valign="top">Amazing photograph, and one really feels the immensity of the structure. But I gotta say I really don''t like the Text there. Mind you, I don''t know where I would put it but...maybe just a diffrent color other than white... Other than that I love it.</td>', 'Amazing photograph, and one really feels the immensity of the structure. But I gotta say I really don''t like the Text there. Mind you, I don''t know where I would put it but...maybe just a diffrent color other than white... Other than that I love it.', '2003-05-07 00:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(289745, 20481, 8084, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like the balance between the sky and the trees. It would be too easy to get too much sky or too many trees, but you got a healthy dose of both. Plus you did well to capture the height of this outcropping. Gotta say though you missed out on a great opportunity for some kind of slogan. Anything...</td>', 'Great photo. I like the balance between the sky and the trees. It would be too easy to get too much sky or too many trees, but you got a healthy dose of both. Plus you did well to capture the height of this outcropping. Gotta say though you missed out on a great opportunity for some kind of slogan. Anything...', '2003-05-07 00:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(289747, 20412, 8084, '<td valign="top">Crap. Something out of the future here. Very..."Robocop" if Robocop was more operatic. (and more filmatic) Those clouds...precision clouds. Lovely.</td>', 'Crap. Something out of the future here. Very..."Robocop" if Robocop was more operatic. (and more filmatic) Those clouds...precision clouds. Lovely.', '2003-05-07 00:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(290157, 20368, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous photo.  Terrific subject, picturesque background.  Really heavy on the WOW factor here.  Not to mention the quality is excellent.  I''m giving this a 9 only because I think you should''ve left a little more room on the left side to give the boat somewhere to travel to.   Very nice work and great capture.</td>', 'This is a tremendous photo.  Terrific subject, picturesque background.  Really heavy on the WOW factor here.  Not to mention the quality is excellent.  I''m giving this a 9 only because I think you should''ve left a little more room on the left side to give the boat somewhere to travel to.   Very nice work and great capture.', '2003-05-07 06:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(290158, 20240, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can''t see a good reason for this to be tilted so I guess you just haven''t straightened it - that horizon really bugs me. Not a great shot, though I like the gull sitting on the motor. The light is very flat, which removes all the depth of texture from the rocks and vegetation, there seems to be a definition problem, everything is slightly out of focus, and there''s quite a lot of digital noise in the sky. Could have been quite interesting if you''d waited ''til the sun was lower in the sky, or of you''d shot with the sun not behind you.</td>', 'Can''t see a good reason for this to be tilted so I guess you just haven''t straightened it - that horizon really bugs me. Not a great shot, though I like the gull sitting on the motor. The light is very flat, which removes all the depth of texture from the rocks and vegetation, there seems to be a definition problem, everything is slightly out of focus, and there''s quite a lot of digital noise in the sky. Could have been quite interesting if you''d waited ''til the sun was lower in the sky, or of you''d shot with the sun not behind you.', '2003-05-07 06:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(290159, 20262, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture, and a fine exposure - great detailing in the light. Lacks a sense of a specific place for me: could be almost anywhere.</td>', 'Good capture, and a fine exposure - great detailing in the light. Lacks a sense of a specific place for me: could be almost anywhere.', '2003-05-07 06:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(290160, 20497, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of how this was cut off at the bottom so much.  I think this is a very cool building and is very suitable to put on film, but I think the pic should''ve been taker from a higher perspective or from further back so the bottom isn''t so cut off.  Nice subject and a good day to shoot it too.</td>', 'I''m not fond of how this was cut off at the bottom so much.  I think this is a very cool building and is very suitable to put on film, but I think the pic should''ve been taker from a higher perspective or from further back so the bottom isn''t so cut off.  Nice subject and a good day to shoot it too.', '2003-05-07 06:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290161, 20268, 3540, '<td valign="top">Holy bright borders batman!!  This is a nice simple composition with a very clear message.  But I''m not real fond of the border that houses this composition.  Still its pretty good.</td>', 'Holy bright borders batman!!  This is a nice simple composition with a very clear message.  But I''m not real fond of the border that houses this composition.  Still its pretty good.', '2003-05-07 06:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(290162, 20532, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark and not focused as well as it could be.  Cool architecture and something definitely worth taking pics of.</td>', 'This is a little dark and not focused as well as it could be.  Cool architecture and something definitely worth taking pics of.', '2003-05-07 06:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(290163, 20434, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the blown out sky.  The colors of the buildings is great though.   The boats make for an interesting water scene too.  Well taken aside from the sky</td>', 'I don''t like the blown out sky.  The colors of the buildings is great though.   The boats make for an interesting water scene too.  Well taken aside from the sky', '2003-05-07 06:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290164, 20412, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow this is cool.  Very calm water, nice long exposure night time type stuff.  I don''t know if this is something I''d ever see on a postcard or not, but it is damn cool nonetheless - 9</td>', 'Wow this is cool.  Very calm water, nice long exposure night time type stuff.  I don''t know if this is something I''d ever see on a postcard or not, but it is damn cool nonetheless - 9', '2003-05-07 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(290166, 20274, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) I do hope this is an ironic entry ... it has all those crass elements of dodgy postcards down to a ''t'': just wonder how many people are going to agree with me. Too much text, pointless (even bizarre) message, excellently done. Really like this.</td>', ':-) I do hope this is an ironic entry ... it has all those crass elements of dodgy postcards down to a ''t'': just wonder how many people are going to agree with me. Too much text, pointless (even bizarre) message, excellently done. Really like this.', '2003-05-07 06:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(290168, 20385, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice place you''ve found, but I think the sky is a little blow out this day.  It is affecting the top of the trees pretty bad too.  A different day would''ve yielded you bette results.  Nice place though.</td>', 'This is a very nice place you''ve found, but I think the sky is a little blow out this day.  It is affecting the top of the trees pretty bad too.  A different day would''ve yielded you bette results.  Nice place though.', '2003-05-07 06:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(290169, 20503, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here and its gorgeous.  Nice shot.  I love these night longer exposure shots and this one is good!</td>', 'I''ve been here and its gorgeous.  Nice shot.  I love these night longer exposure shots and this one is good!', '2003-05-07 06:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290431, 20298, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I particularly like the lighting on the field of grain.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I particularly like the lighting on the field of grain.', '2003-05-07 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(290434, 20382, 3290, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a little overexposed, and the text is hard to read. But I like the location. Why are they the Caves of Insanity?</td>', 'The shot looks a little overexposed, and the text is hard to read. But I like the location. Why are they the Caves of Insanity?', '2003-05-07 11:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(290436, 20322, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice picture in general, but a tad overexposed I think.</td>', 'Nice picture in general, but a tad overexposed I think.', '2003-05-07 11:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(290438, 20395, 3290, '<td valign="top">Excellent. This could be the winner. My only complaint is that apart from the water, the rest of the shot is a little dark.</td>', 'Excellent. This could be the winner. My only complaint is that apart from the water, the rest of the shot is a little dark.', '2003-05-07 11:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290440, 20439, 3290, '<td valign="top">Classic postcard shot. I''d perhaps tweak the saturation up a little, but otherwise nice. Would like to see the same shot taken in Summer.</td>', 'Classic postcard shot. I''d perhaps tweak the saturation up a little, but otherwise nice. Would like to see the same shot taken in Summer.', '2003-05-07 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(290446, 20481, 3290, '<td valign="top">Excellent. How much did you have to pay him to stand there? You''d have to pay me a lot! It''s a tiny bit dull - perhaps tweak the contrast/brightness a little.</td>', 'Excellent. How much did you have to pay him to stand there? You''d have to pay me a lot! It''s a tiny bit dull - perhaps tweak the contrast/brightness a little.', '2003-05-07 11:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(290447, 20334, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very nice. My favourite flower. Good subject for a postcard. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. My favourite flower. Good subject for a postcard. Well done.', '2003-05-07 11:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290448, 20168, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great perspective of a familiar subject. Would have been perfect with the sun (or moon) in the shot too.</td>', 'Great perspective of a familiar subject. Would have been perfect with the sun (or moon) in the shot too.', '2003-05-07 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(290449, 20383, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-05-07 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290450, 20523, 3290, '<td valign="top">Imaginitive framing. Well done.</td>', 'Imaginitive framing. Well done.', '2003-05-07 11:39:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(290452, 20456, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice. Not sure about the flowers in the foreground though, and the text isn''t quite central.</td>', 'Good subject choice. Not sure about the flowers in the foreground though, and the text isn''t quite central.', '2003-05-07 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(290457, 20262, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft, gentle colours. If it''s a postcard, it''s crying out for some text in the bottom right.</td>', 'Lovely soft, gentle colours. If it''s a postcard, it''s crying out for some text in the bottom right.', '2003-05-07 11:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(290468, 20497, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines. I find myself wanting to see the bottom of the parts of the  building in the distance, though. I think I''d have preferred it with the camera pointed downwards a little.</td>', 'Interesting lines. I find myself wanting to see the bottom of the parts of the  building in the distance, though. I think I''d have preferred it with the camera pointed downwards a little.', '2003-05-07 11:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290471, 20435, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the butterfly is a little soft.</td>', 'Pretty, but the butterfly is a little soft.', '2003-05-07 11:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(290474, 20210, 3290, '<td valign="top">Picture is great, but the text is slightly obtrusive.</td>', 'Picture is great, but the text is slightly obtrusive.', '2003-05-07 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(290480, 20240, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. but the horizon is slanted - needs a slight rotation clockwise in your picture editor.</td>', 'Nice scene. but the horizon is slanted - needs a slight rotation clockwise in your picture editor.', '2003-05-07 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290484, 20356, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture. I''d like to see the waterfall sharp as well as the flower (I think).</td>', 'Very pretty picture. I''d like to see the waterfall sharp as well as the flower (I think).', '2003-05-07 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290486, 20405, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot with great colours and light. The perspective is great too. Very well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot with great colours and light. The perspective is great too. Very well done.', '2003-05-07 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(290492, 20207, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a pleasant spot.</td>', 'Nice capture of a pleasant spot.', '2003-05-07 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(290518, 19993, 3290, '<td valign="top">Colourful shot. Shame about the satellite dish, though. Not much you could do about it. Might have worked better if the sign had been shot head on, if possible.</td>', 'Colourful shot. Shame about the satellite dish, though. Not much you could do about it. Might have worked better if the sign had been shot head on, if possible.', '2003-05-07 11:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290519, 20422, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colourful shot. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting, colourful shot. Well done.', '2003-05-07 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290525, 20417, 3290, '<td valign="top">Arf arf. Good subject - where''s this, the Arndale Centre?</td>', 'Arf arf. Good subject - where''s this, the Arndale Centre?', '2003-05-07 12:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(290528, 20078, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. I think I''d crop out the bow of the white boat on the left.</td>', 'Pretty scene. I think I''d crop out the bow of the white boat on the left.', '2003-05-07 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(290530, 20254, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colours.</td>', 'Great colours.', '2003-05-07 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(290532, 20411, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great colours. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Great colours. Very nice shot.', '2003-05-07 12:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(290533, 20384, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great scene, but could do with a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Great scene, but could do with a bit more contrast.', '2003-05-07 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290536, 20252, 3290, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that George VI? That''s a very large coin - what''s the story?</td>', 'Isn''t that George VI? That''s a very large coin - what''s the story?', '2003-05-07 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(290537, 20154, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-05-07 12:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(290542, 20209, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent set up.  It looks like you''re standing in the water.  Seems a bit soft or out of focus though.</td>', 'Excellent set up.  It looks like you''re standing in the water.  Seems a bit soft or out of focus though.', '2003-05-07 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(290545, 20270, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great choice of border.  Different and interesting.</td>', 'Great choice of border.  Different and interesting.', '2003-05-07 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290546, 20317, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, but looks rather oversharpened.</td>', 'Pretty scene, but looks rather oversharpened.', '2003-05-07 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(290549, 20336, 3290, '<td valign="top">Impressive. I like the richness of the colours in this shot. Adding something to give it a sense of scale might make it even better.</td>', 'Impressive. I like the richness of the colours in this shot. Adding something to give it a sense of scale might make it even better.', '2003-05-07 12:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(290552, 20353, 3290, '<td valign="top">The sign takes up too much of the shot. Shame about the graffiti too. I think I''d have made the cable car itself the focal point.</td>', 'The sign takes up too much of the shot. Shame about the graffiti too. I think I''d have made the cable car itself the focal point.', '2003-05-07 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(290555, 20112, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The slightly washed-out effect makes it seem old.</td>', 'Great composition. The slightly washed-out effect makes it seem old.', '2003-05-07 12:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(290556, 20540, 7291, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the choice of text but the picture itself is nice.  For a moment I thought it might be in South Beach (Miami, FL)</td>', 'I don''t like the choice of text but the picture itself is nice.  For a moment I thought it might be in South Beach (Miami, FL)', '2003-05-07 12:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(290561, 19823, 7291, '<td valign="top">Funny.  I have a friend from Fargo and he found it hilarious.  Good choice of text placement and font style.</td>', 'Funny.  I have a friend from Fargo and he found it hilarious.  Good choice of text placement and font style.', '2003-05-07 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(290568, 20414, 7291, '<td valign="top">The telephone pole takes something away from the picture.  The white water is nice though.</td>', 'The telephone pole takes something away from the picture.  The white water is nice though.', '2003-05-07 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(290574, 20207, 7291, '<td valign="top">This looks like something right off the rack in a Tourist Center.  Excellent job.  Can find nothing wrong with it at all.  The shadow behind the text is a great touch.</td>', 'This looks like something right off the rack in a Tourist Center.  Excellent job.  Can find nothing wrong with it at all.  The shadow behind the text is a great touch.', '2003-05-07 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(290575, 20497, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The curves are great.  I feel that the bottom text doasn''t match the overall feel of the picture though.  Some text in the sky portion might have been a good alternative.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The curves are great.  I feel that the bottom text doasn''t match the overall feel of the picture though.  Some text in the sky portion might have been a good alternative.', '2003-05-07 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(290580, 20154, 8563, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2003-05-07 12:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(290588, 20506, 8563, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Is this by the river in Wichita?</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Is this by the river in Wichita?', '2003-05-07 12:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290591, 20380, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  Not the shape of a postcard though.   Well done anyway.</td>', 'Very pretty!  Not the shape of a postcard though.   Well done anyway.', '2003-05-07 12:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290595, 20269, 7291, '<td valign="top">This loks like a post card that I would pay for send to someone if I were to visit.  Outstanding job!  Perfect choice of text placement and font style.</td>', 'This loks like a post card that I would pay for send to someone if I were to visit.  Outstanding job!  Perfect choice of text placement and font style.', '2003-05-07 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(290596, 20396, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but it''s missing text.  A nice border would also compliment the picture nicely.  Looks like a great place to visit.</td>', 'Great picture, but it''s missing text.  A nice border would also compliment the picture nicely.  Looks like a great place to visit.', '2003-05-07 12:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(290600, 20511, 7291, '<td valign="top">GREAT picture....but it doesn''t meet the challenge.  I know, I know.  You''ve already heard that but it''s true.</td>', 'GREAT picture....but it doesn''t meet the challenge.  I know, I know.  You''ve already heard that but it''s true.', '2003-05-07 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290607, 20168, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great angle on a very popular subject.  I feel that the text doesn''t quite match the flowing mood of the picture but the final product is great anyway. - 9</td>', 'Great angle on a very popular subject.  I feel that the text doesn''t quite match the flowing mood of the picture but the final product is great anyway. - 9', '2003-05-07 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(290611, 20384, 7291, '<td valign="top">Beaituful scenery.  Seems a bit dark though.  Clear skys would bump this to the top. - 8</td>', 'Beaituful scenery.  Seems a bit dark though.  Clear skys would bump this to the top. - 8', '2003-05-07 12:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(290623, 20383, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very calm mood to this picture.  Good job.  Composition is great and the choice of text compliments this well. - 10</td>', 'Very calm mood to this picture.  Good job.  Composition is great and the choice of text compliments this well. - 10', '2003-05-07 12:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(290675, 20240, 7354, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Picture, perfect for a postcard!<br/></td>', 'Beautiful Picture, perfect for a postcard!', '2003-05-07 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290679, 20262, 7354, '<td valign="top">This picture is gorgeous and is perfect for a postcard.<br/></td>', 'This picture is gorgeous and is perfect for a postcard.', '2003-05-07 13:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(290681, 20481, 7354, '<td valign="top">Everything''s so green! It''s beautiful and makes a great postcard.<br/></td>', 'Everything''s so green! It''s beautiful and makes a great postcard.', '2003-05-07 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(290693, 20506, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the reflections, but the tilted horizon disturbs me.</td>', 'I like the colours and the reflections, but the tilted horizon disturbs me.', '2003-05-07 13:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(290695, 20412, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool night shot. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the darker areas though. The boats(?) in the lower left are a bit hard to make out.</td>', 'Cool night shot. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the darker areas though. The boats(?) in the lower left are a bit hard to make out.', '2003-05-07 13:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(290696, 20525, 3290, '<td valign="top">Those are long horns, alright.</td>', 'Those are long horns, alright.', '2003-05-07 13:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(290698, 20448, 3290, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting building. What is it?</td>', 'That''s an interesting building. What is it?', '2003-05-07 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(290700, 20432, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. I''d move the whole thing right a bit, to take in the waterfall and leave out the tree.</td>', 'Pretty scene. I''d move the whole thing right a bit, to take in the waterfall and leave out the tree.', '2003-05-07 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(290703, 20434, 3290, '<td valign="top">Colourful.</td>', 'Colourful.', '2003-05-07 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(290704, 20269, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but the text is overpowering.</td>', 'I like the picture, but the text is overpowering.', '2003-05-07 13:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(290712, 20209, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. Picture seems a little soft and a little noisy.</td>', 'Nice scene. Picture seems a little soft and a little noisy.', '2003-05-07 13:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(290727, 20432, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely lovely composition, I wish there was more daylight to brighten all the colours though.</td>', 'absolutely lovely composition, I wish there was more daylight to brighten all the colours though.', '2003-05-07 13:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(290733, 20268, 7711, '<td valign="top">lovely picture, but that border just murders it. its a bit too bright and too thick, distracts from your elegant composition.</td>', 'lovely picture, but that border just murders it. its a bit too bright and too thick, distracts from your elegant composition.', '2003-05-07 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290748, 20521, 7711, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful sunset, but the border is too heavy and the colour distracts me from the serene image of the sunset. Its also not even with some extra buff colour emerging fro the brown on the right and even more on the left. Perhaps a thinner border all around would be more subtle and complimentary? :)</td>', 'what a beautiful sunset, but the border is too heavy and the colour distracts me from the serene image of the sunset. Its also not even with some extra buff colour emerging fro the brown on the right and even more on the left. Perhaps a thinner border all around would be more subtle and complimentary? :)', '2003-05-07 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290751, 20395, 7711, '<td valign="top">the shot seems a bit dark, and the heavy border only adds to that feeling. However, I really like your composition-- i feel like I''m in the action. :)</td>', 'the shot seems a bit dark, and the heavy border only adds to that feeling. However, I really like your composition-- i feel like I''m in the action. :)', '2003-05-07 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(290753, 20383, 7711, '<td valign="top">wonderful leading lines with the water, lights and line of houses. Very well done.</td>', 'wonderful leading lines with the water, lights and line of houses. Very well done.', '2003-05-07 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(290758, 20298, 7711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in this shot. Its simple and lovely, and I like the border, font and text you chose. Would be even more stunning if the yellows were just a bit brighter to contrast with the blueness of the mountain and the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful colours in this shot. Its simple and lovely, and I like the border, font and text you chose. Would be even more stunning if the yellows were just a bit brighter to contrast with the blueness of the mountain and the sky.', '2003-05-07 13:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(290759, 20497, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love this place, and I think you really captured the essence of its flowing architecture, i like the "yingyang" balance you have with half the frame as sky and the other half as the flowing lines of the building.</td>', 'I love this place, and I think you really captured the essence of its flowing architecture, i like the "yingyang" balance you have with half the frame as sky and the other half as the flowing lines of the building.', '2003-05-07 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(290763, 20351, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that I''m not american causes this picture not to make a lot of sense to me. I like to think of a postcard as reminding me of somewhere I''ve been or the person who sent it to me (if its not of some landmark or landscape), but I just don''t get that feel here. Compositionally, I think the crop is a bit tight around the top of the clock and I wish we could see more of both the basket of peanuts and the clock itself.</td>', 'I think the fact that I''m not american causes this picture not to make a lot of sense to me. I like to think of a postcard as reminding me of somewhere I''ve been or the person who sent it to me (if its not of some landmark or landscape), but I just don''t get that feel here. Compositionally, I think the crop is a bit tight around the top of the clock and I wish we could see more of both the basket of peanuts and the clock itself.', '2003-05-07 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(290767, 20138, 7711, '<td valign="top">the buildings, water and boats seem a bit dark, I wish they were brighter so we could see more of their detail.</td>', 'the buildings, water and boats seem a bit dark, I wish they were brighter so we could see more of their detail.', '2003-05-07 13:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(290773, 20405, 7711, '<td valign="top">quaint. i''ve never been to tecklenburg, but i feel like this postcard does a good job of conveying what it is like. Quaint, charming, and slightly hilly!  :)</td>', 'quaint. i''ve never been to tecklenburg, but i feel like this postcard does a good job of conveying what it is like. Quaint, charming, and slightly hilly!  :)', '2003-05-07 13:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290776, 20419, 7711, '<td valign="top">magnificent! I would have liked to creep up on the castle a bit more, but I recognize that the terrain might not have allowed you to get closer and still be able to see the castle on a high enough plane.</td>', 'magnificent! I would have liked to creep up on the castle a bit more, but I recognize that the terrain might not have allowed you to get closer and still be able to see the castle on a high enough plane.', '2003-05-07 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290792, 20368, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gosh this a great photograph - love the light in the sky, and especially contrasted with the kind of humdrum lighting on the ferry. My quibble would be, and I bet I''m not alone, that this isn''t exactly a postcard of a place, is it? Should have been in the transportation challenge (if it was, forgive me - didn''t vote on transportation).</td>', 'Gosh this a great photograph - love the light in the sky, and especially contrasted with the kind of humdrum lighting on the ferry. My quibble would be, and I bet I''m not alone, that this isn''t exactly a postcard of a place, is it? Should have been in the transportation challenge (if it was, forgive me - didn''t vote on transportation).', '2003-05-07 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(290794, 20535, 7291, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for the text.  Unique.</td>', 'Interesting choice for the text.  Unique.', '2003-05-07 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290796, 20435, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - is the focus fractionally out? The second from right bud seems more in focus than the butterfly and flower.</td>', 'Nice shot - is the focus fractionally out? The second from right bud seems more in focus than the butterfly and flower.', '2003-05-07 14:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(290797, 19993, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very coloful.  Could use a nice border.  The satelite dish looks out of place but it''s not too abvious. - 8</td>', 'Very coloful.  Could use a nice border.  The satelite dish looks out of place but it''s not too abvious. - 8', '2003-05-07 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(290799, 20511, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great shot - but postcard? There was a requirement to be relevant to your location in the challenge, and this could be anywhere. Still a great photo, but not as it stands for this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot - but postcard? There was a requirement to be relevant to your location in the challenge, and this could be anywhere. Still a great photo, but not as it stands for this challenge.', '2003-05-07 14:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(290803, 20481, 7291, '<td valign="top">Having that person up there really adds a ton of perspective to the picture.  Great shot.</td>', 'Having that person up there really adds a ton of perspective to the picture.  Great shot.', '2003-05-07 14:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(290804, 20437, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - looks like it''s actually cropped to ''postcard'' dimensions too. Like the font, and the reasonable unintrusiveness of the text. Mor of a photographers postcard perhaps than a real seller, but high marks all the same.</td>', 'Good work - looks like it''s actually cropped to ''postcard'' dimensions too. Like the font, and the reasonable unintrusiveness of the text. Mor of a photographers postcard perhaps than a real seller, but high marks all the same.', '2003-05-07 14:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(290808, 20482, 7291, '<td valign="top">Picture Perfect postcard.  Great job seeing the potential in just shooting the spurs and placing the text on the right.  You should look into selling this. - 10</td>', 'Picture Perfect postcard.  Great job seeing the potential in just shooting the spurs and placing the text on the right.  You should look into selling this. - 10', '2003-05-07 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(290811, 20543, 6999, '<td valign="top">That big blank expanse of wall doesn''t help this shot - as a postcard, that is. It makes me wonder if the view from 90 degrees to the left isn''t better ...  and the way the trees obscure the building also doesn''t help. Also looks like a bit of over-sharpening has gone on around the top of the building, but other than that a good solid technical shot. can imagine it on a postcard stand - but I wouldn''t buy it!</td>', 'That big blank expanse of wall doesn''t help this shot - as a postcard, that is. It makes me wonder if the view from 90 degrees to the left isn''t better ...  and the way the trees obscure the building also doesn''t help. Also looks like a bit of over-sharpening has gone on around the top of the building, but other than that a good solid technical shot. can imagine it on a postcard stand - but I wouldn''t buy it!', '2003-05-07 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(290813, 20353, 7291, '<td valign="top">That''s great the way you captured the trolly crossing behind the "Xing" sign.  Looks like an excellent representation of the city.</td>', 'That''s great the way you captured the trolly crossing behind the "Xing" sign.  Looks like an excellent representation of the city.', '2003-05-07 14:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(290814, 20356, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the DOF putting the actual waterfall so out of focus when you''ve given it that title. Also wonder if you couldn''t have reduced the exposure a little - the flowers are OK but perhaps a stop or two less wouldn''t hurt, but there''s too much light on the waterfall. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Not sure about the DOF putting the actual waterfall so out of focus when you''ve given it that title. Also wonder if you couldn''t have reduced the exposure a little - the flowers are OK but perhaps a stop or two less wouldn''t hurt, but there''s too much light on the waterfall. Nicely composed.', '2003-05-07 14:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(290815, 20417, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great angle on the shot.  The hilighted text is perfect.</td>', 'Great angle on the shot.  The hilighted text is perfect.', '2003-05-07 14:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(290820, 20446, 7291, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective.  Look very professional. - 10</td>', 'Simple, yet effective.  Look very professional. - 10', '2003-05-07 14:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290822, 20210, 7291, '<td valign="top">The text is a little over powering.  Nice picture though.</td>', 'The text is a little over powering.  Nice picture though.', '2003-05-07 14:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(290828, 20518, 7291, '<td valign="top">Pure New York!!!  Perhaps my favorite city in the world.  Can''t find a thing wrong with this picture at all. - 10</td>', 'Pure New York!!!  Perhaps my favorite city in the world.  Can''t find a thing wrong with this picture at all. - 10', '2003-05-07 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(290832, 20411, 7291, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Even though the sky looks over saturated, the picture is wonderful.</td>', 'Whoa!  Even though the sky looks over saturated, the picture is wonderful.', '2003-05-07 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(290835, 20514, 7291, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is a nice touch and the text makes excellent use of negative space.</td>', 'The soft focus is a nice touch and the text makes excellent use of negative space.', '2003-05-07 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(290843, 20334, 7291, '<td valign="top">Is this a picture or a drawing?  Whatever it is, it''s really nice but I think this falls under digital art.</td>', 'Is this a picture or a drawing?  Whatever it is, it''s really nice but I think this falls under digital art.', '2003-05-07 14:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(290846, 20382, 7291, '<td valign="top">Caves of Insanity?  I now you''ve probably already been asked but what''s the reason behind the name?  It''s a nice picture but I think it could do without the tree in the foreground.</td>', 'Caves of Insanity?  I now you''ve probably already been asked but what''s the reason behind the name?  It''s a nice picture but I think it could do without the tree in the foreground.', '2003-05-07 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(290852, 20525, 7291, '<td valign="top">HEY, I was in Breckenridge, Colorado this weekend.  Looks a little different. Nice picture.  They all seem to be posing for you.</td>', 'HEY, I was in Breckenridge, Colorado this weekend.  Looks a little different. Nice picture.  They all seem to be posing for you.', '2003-05-07 14:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(290856, 20298, 7291, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture!  Good choice of font style but it could do without the words "View of." - 9</td>', 'Gorgeous picture!  Good choice of font style but it could do without the words "View of." - 9', '2003-05-07 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(290865, 20437, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking.  Great composition.</td>', 'Very professional looking.  Great composition.', '2003-05-07 14:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(290871, 20422, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great color!!!  I don\''t understand the title though.</td>', 'Great color!!!  I don\''t understand the title though.', '2003-05-07 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(290979, 20462, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - it makes me want to visit!</td>', 'I like this a lot - it makes me want to visit!', '2003-05-07 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(291002, 20434, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, except for the white sky.  That detracts.</td>', 'I like this very much, except for the white sky.  That detracts.', '2003-05-07 16:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(291005, 20395, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I''d love to visit! The contrast is a bit much.  The whites are a little blown out in spots and the darks, too dark to see much detail. I realize you had to compromise, it''s a tough picture to take.  <br/>Your sky is a beautiful blue.</td>', 'Pretty.  I''d love to visit! The contrast is a bit much.  The whites are a little blown out in spots and the darks, too dark to see much detail. I realize you had to compromise, it''s a tough picture to take.  Your sky is a beautiful blue.', '2003-05-07 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(291006, 20269, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!  Wonderful sky, good skyline, good font, well exposed, good dof.</td>', 'Excellent job!  Wonderful sky, good skyline, good font, well exposed, good dof.', '2003-05-07 16:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(291008, 20448, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good composition. nice sky color.  Would like it better if I knew what the landmark is.  The geyser is nice.</td>', 'Good composition. nice sky color.  Would like it better if I knew what the landmark is.  The geyser is nice.', '2003-05-07 16:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(291011, 20511, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image, but not very postcardy, I''m afraid. What it really looks like is one of those Successories or ''Despair.com'' motivational posters.</td>', 'Gorgeous image, but not very postcardy, I''m afraid. What it really looks like is one of those Successories or ''Despair.com'' motivational posters.', '2003-05-07 16:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(291013, 20515, 8488, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem all that postcardy to me ... and just as an image, it''s also not very interesting. There''s no focal point, nothing for the picture to be ''about'', per se, and the lighting is very stark, very plain.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem all that postcardy to me ... and just as an image, it''s also not very interesting. There''s no focal point, nothing for the picture to be ''about'', per se, and the lighting is very stark, very plain.', '2003-05-07 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(291014, 20504, 8488, '<td valign="top">The cropping is claustrophobic, and I really can''t see this on a post card. Nice color, nice focus, though.</td>', 'The cropping is claustrophobic, and I really can''t see this on a post card. Nice color, nice focus, though.', '2003-05-07 16:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(291015, 20364, 8488, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little too tightly for a classic ''postcard'' look ... and, pardon me, but it''s ugly. IMHO. :-&gt; Nice focus and colors and contrast, though. It''s just ... busy, and there''s no compositional center.</td>', 'Cropped a little too tightly for a classic ''postcard'' look ... and, pardon me, but it''s ugly. IMHO. :-> Nice focus and colors and contrast, though. It''s just ... busy, and there''s no compositional center.', '2003-05-07 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(291016, 20540, 8488, '<td valign="top">The composition is juuuuuuust crooked-looking enough to make me feel like I''m the one that''s aslant, slightly. Kind of uncomfortable. The lighting feels odd, too. Plus, I can''t see it on a postcard, and since that''s the theme ...</td>', 'The composition is juuuuuuust crooked-looking enough to make me feel like I''m the one that''s aslant, slightly. Kind of uncomfortable. The lighting feels odd, too. Plus, I can''t see it on a postcard, and since that''s the theme ...', '2003-05-07 16:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(291017, 20427, 8488, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a snapshot than a postcard, to me, and the composition''s busy and uncentered. There''s no ''point'' going on, no reason, or purpose, or focal point.</td>', 'Looks more like a snapshot than a postcard, to me, and the composition''s busy and uncentered. There''s no ''point'' going on, no reason, or purpose, or focal point.', '2003-05-07 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(291018, 20262, 8488, '<td valign="top">It does look very like a postcard ... but a kind of ugly postcard, the sort I wouldn''t buy. :-&gt; I don''t know if that''s helpful or not, but I wanted to let you know why you got a 7 instead of something higher.</td>', 'It does look very like a postcard ... but a kind of ugly postcard, the sort I wouldn''t buy. :-> I don''t know if that''s helpful or not, but I wanted to let you know why you got a 7 instead of something higher.', '2003-05-07 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(291019, 20317, 1280, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!  Inviting.  I really like that you included the growth in the water.  It adds another dimension.</td>', 'How beautiful!  Inviting.  I really like that you included the growth in the water.  It adds another dimension.', '2003-05-07 16:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(291020, 20424, 8488, '<td valign="top">It might look more postcardy if it were cropped differently, or if the cows were photographed from a slightly different angle.</td>', 'It might look more postcardy if it were cropped differently, or if the cows were photographed from a slightly different angle.', '2003-05-07 16:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(291022, 20334, 8488, '<td valign="top">The distortions to the image are kind of precious, in a way that annoys me slightly, and worse than that, in a way that''s not very postcardy. It *is* pretty, though. If you''d just not messed with it I''d probably have marked it 10.</td>', 'The distortions to the image are kind of precious, in a way that annoys me slightly, and worse than that, in a way that''s not very postcardy. It *is* pretty, though. If you''d just not messed with it I''d probably have marked it 10.', '2003-05-07 16:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(291024, 20481, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  It''s the kind of place I love...the great outdoors.  Including a person for scale really makes this even better.  Good job! Where is this?</td>', 'Fantastic!  It''s the kind of place I love...the great outdoors.  Including a person for scale really makes this even better.  Good job! Where is this?', '2003-05-07 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(291025, 20521, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice simple comp.  I don''t care for the way the sun blows into the tree though.  Still nice!</td>', 'Nice simple comp.  I don''t care for the way the sun blows into the tree though.  Still nice!', '2003-05-07 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(291030, 20504, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between old and new here.  I''m not sure I like the way it looks kind of one dimensional.  Like cutouts.  I also don''t like the white bg too much.  I love this old building.  Really beautiful!  I think a less chunky font would be more attractive.</td>', 'I like the contrast between old and new here.  I''m not sure I like the way it looks kind of one dimensional.  Like cutouts.  I also don''t like the white bg too much.  I love this old building.  Really beautiful!  I think a less chunky font would be more attractive.', '2003-05-07 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(291032, 20322, 1280, '<td valign="top">This sure meets the challenge.  Looks like a postcard to me.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'This sure meets the challenge.  Looks like a postcard to me.  :-)  Good luck!', '2003-05-07 16:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(291034, 20497, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architecture and very nicely composed.  The blue sky looks good too. Good shadows on the building show dimension.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful architecture and very nicely composed.  The blue sky looks good too. Good shadows on the building show dimension.  Good job!', '2003-05-07 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(291039, 20262, 1280, '<td valign="top">The color is gorgeous, especially reflected on the water.  The diagonal comp is good.  Should have included some text on the sand, but no big deal.  Still a good postcard...from where???</td>', 'The color is gorgeous, especially reflected on the water.  The diagonal comp is good.  Should have included some text on the sand, but no big deal.  Still a good postcard...from where???', '2003-05-07 16:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(291041, 20267, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Utah is indeed a beautiful state.</td>', 'Nice.  Utah is indeed a beautiful state.', '2003-05-07 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(291043, 20364, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Good color too.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Good color too.', '2003-05-07 16:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(291048, 20454, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Love the house and stream in the lower third.  Not crazy about your placement of text.  I know it''s personal taste but I think it would be better down on the bottom, or eliminated all together.  "California Foothills" is enough.</td>', 'Great composition.  Love the house and stream in the lower third.  Not crazy about your placement of text.  I know it''s personal taste but I think it would be better down on the bottom, or eliminated all together.  "California Foothills" is enough.', '2003-05-07 16:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(291057, 20419, 1280, '<td valign="top">NIce view but a little too contrasty.  The sky looks a bit blown out.</td>', 'NIce view but a little too contrasty.  The sky looks a bit blown out.', '2003-05-07 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(291063, 20379, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-05-07 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(291067, 20111, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love how you captured the bridge and this old build''s beautiful archways in one shot. The contrast of the red brick against the cold stone and metal bridge and blue sky make for a very stunning composition.</td>', 'I love how you captured the bridge and this old build''s beautiful archways in one shot. The contrast of the red brick against the cold stone and metal bridge and blue sky make for a very stunning composition.', '2003-05-07 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(291070, 20482, 7711, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail I thought this was a real cowboy''s boot, I almost wish it was, but still I love the idea. The shot is a bit dark near the top right of the frame, but that does give you a more even background to put readable text on so it all works.</td>', 'From the thumbnail I thought this was a real cowboy''s boot, I almost wish it was, but still I love the idea. The shot is a bit dark near the top right of the frame, but that does give you a more even background to put readable text on so it all works.', '2003-05-07 17:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(291076, 20353, 7711, '<td valign="top">the crop seems a little tight at the top of the sign..maybe a another few millimetres of sky above it? Also, the graffiti on the sign is really a shame, and takes away from the "beauty" of the scene.</td>', 'the crop seems a little tight at the top of the sign..maybe a another few millimetres of sky above it? Also, the graffiti on the sign is really a shame, and takes away from the "beauty" of the scene.', '2003-05-07 17:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(291079, 20309, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice angle on the lighthouse. A crop of the foreground would cut out those not very attractive driftwood logs and keep attention on your subject.</td>', 'nice angle on the lighthouse. A crop of the foreground would cut out those not very attractive driftwood logs and keep attention on your subject.', '2003-05-07 17:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(291085, 20532, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful building, and I like the activity you have captured around them. They look useful and a part of life still. Howeve, the shot seems a little dark and dull, and the building is in a big shadow that takes away from its beauty and detail. Maybe if you shot during a brighter day or did some post processing adjustments to brightness and contrast? :)</td>', 'beautiful building, and I like the activity you have captured around them. They look useful and a part of life still. Howeve, the shot seems a little dark and dull, and the building is in a big shadow that takes away from its beauty and detail. Maybe if you shot during a brighter day or did some post processing adjustments to brightness and contrast? :)', '2003-05-07 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(291092, 20280, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like how the building mimics the shape of the mountains behind it, lovely composition, though the building is a bit darker than I would have liked. Probably because of the bright whites in the sky and mountains.</td>', 'I like how the building mimics the shape of the mountains behind it, lovely composition, though the building is a bit darker than I would have liked. Probably because of the bright whites in the sky and mountains.', '2003-05-07 17:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
