(292657, 20351, 3080, '<td valign="top">This made me think of one time when we were down south and we walked into a resteraunt and there were peanut shells all over the floor.  I was shocked to see people just chucking the shells all over the floor.  I found out later that it''s illegal now in MI to do that because it''s a health violation.  Anyway, I thought it was pretty cool.  So this shot brings back a "down south" memory for me.  I only wish it were a bit sharper.  It''s not bad, but I think it could be bette. ~Heather~</td>', 'This made me think of one time when we were down south and we walked into a resteraunt and there were peanut shells all over the floor.  I was shocked to see people just chucking the shells all over the floor.  I found out later that it''s illegal now in MI to do that because it''s a health violation.  Anyway, I thought it was pretty cool.  So this shot brings back a "down south" memory for me.  I only wish it were a bit sharper.  It''s not bad, but I think it could be bette. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(292661, 20428, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the focus and clarity you have here.  I also like the angle and framing/cropping you chose to capture this at.  Looks like it was taken out a window in another building or something.  Kind of a "looking down" on the scene.  That is really nice.  I wonder why you went with the mud color?  Still a nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I love the focus and clarity you have here.  I also like the angle and framing/cropping you chose to capture this at.  Looks like it was taken out a window in another building or something.  Kind of a "looking down" on the scene.  That is really nice.  I wonder why you went with the mud color?  Still a nice shot. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(292663, 20364, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really really like this.  Saw the thumbnail awhile ago, and couldn''t wait to get to this one.  The only proble I see is that the words "Delta King Hotel" kind of bug my eyes out.  I''m not sure if it''s just the way it is, or if the focus is just a tad soft, but I still love it anyway.  Very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'I really really like this.  Saw the thumbnail awhile ago, and couldn''t wait to get to this one.  The only proble I see is that the words "Delta King Hotel" kind of bug my eyes out.  I''m not sure if it''s just the way it is, or if the focus is just a tad soft, but I still love it anyway.  Very nice. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(292666, 20503, 3080, '<td valign="top">My favorite part about this is the reflection in the water.  I like very much the colors.  The city it''s self is a bit busy, but I can''t expect you to control that. lol.  A very nice night shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  You captured the reflections very well also. ~Heather~</td>', 'My favorite part about this is the reflection in the water.  I like very much the colors.  The city it''s self is a bit busy, but I can''t expect you to control that. lol.  A very nice night shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  You captured the reflections very well also. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292671, 20154, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I especially like the bird in the upper left.  The colors are great.  The sun is a bit bright, but what can I expect huh?  It''s the SUN.  Love the colors in the sunrise.  We are second shift people, and I don''t get to see too many sunrises.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and I like how you have the brush in the forground.  Nice touch. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very pretty. I especially like the bird in the upper left.  The colors are great.  The sun is a bit bright, but what can I expect huh?  It''s the SUN.  Love the colors in the sunrise.  We are second shift people, and I don''t get to see too many sunrises.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and I like how you have the brush in the forground.  Nice touch. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(292673, 20334, 1280, '<td valign="top">I really love how you did this.  A beautiful botanic!! Good postcard!</td>', 'I really love how you did this.  A beautiful botanic!! Good postcard!', '2003-05-09 00:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(292674, 20396, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but without some kind of knowledge of what it is exactly, or even WHERE it is, I don''t think i''d buy it as a postcard.  About the image though, it''s a wonderful shot.  The sky is great, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose.  Especially how you have the foam in the bottom left corner.  nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but without some kind of knowledge of what it is exactly, or even WHERE it is, I don''t think i''d buy it as a postcard.  About the image though, it''s a wonderful shot.  The sky is great, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose.  Especially how you have the foam in the bottom left corner.  nice. ~Heather~', '2003-05-09 00:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(292685, 20342, 7711, '<td valign="top">the amazing glare/brightness through and off the shrine make it hard to notice any of the other details of the photograph, including the loverly staircase.</td>', 'the amazing glare/brightness through and off the shrine make it hard to notice any of the other details of the photograph, including the loverly staircase.', '2003-05-09 00:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(292689, 20252, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good post card subject. Composition is good. Colors would need to be more dramatic to draw attention on the post card rack.</td>', 'Good post card subject. Composition is good. Colors would need to be more dramatic to draw attention on the post card rack.', '2003-05-09 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(292690, 20543, 7711, '<td valign="top">the sky colour looks unnatural, but I love the sharpness and detail on the building..we can see the bricks! Also , there are too many trees obstructing the view..a slightly different angle with fewer of them in the shot might have helped!</td>', 'the sky colour looks unnatural, but I love the sharpness and detail on the building..we can see the bricks! Also , there are too many trees obstructing the view..a slightly different angle with fewer of them in the shot might have helped!', '2003-05-09 00:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(292692, 19947, 7711, '<td valign="top">very pretty colours, but the entire shot lacks a main point of interest, and there might be just a tad too much sky!</td>', 'very pretty colours, but the entire shot lacks a main point of interest, and there might be just a tad too much sky!', '2003-05-09 00:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(292693, 20540, 6325, '<td valign="top">Could be an interesting subject. Would need  to be straighened and focused more sharply for me to take it off the postcard display.</td>', 'Could be an interesting subject. Would need  to be straighened and focused more sharply for me to take it off the postcard display.', '2003-05-09 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292696, 20422, 7711, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot. One of the best of the challenge in my opinion! 10</td>', 'I adore this shot. One of the best of the challenge in my opinion! 10', '2003-05-09 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(292700, 20336, 7711, '<td valign="top">fabulous shot, I love the green grass and the earth against the blue sky! The perspective makes the monument truly tower!</td>', 'fabulous shot, I love the green grass and the earth against the blue sky! The perspective makes the monument truly tower!', '2003-05-09 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(292703, 20422, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition. The soft focus is not the best choice for this subject, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition. The soft focus is not the best choice for this subject, in my opinion.', '2003-05-09 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292704, 20332, 7711, '<td valign="top">great shot and love the titled angle, adds a sense of excitement to the shot! Its a bit too grainy and out of focus though.</td>', 'great shot and love the titled angle, adds a sense of excitement to the shot! Its a bit too grainy and out of focus though.', '2003-05-09 00:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(292708, 20364, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think a nice white border would be a good finishing touch..perhaps 4 pixels?</td>', 'i think a nice white border would be a good finishing touch..perhaps 4 pixels?', '2003-05-09 01:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(292709, 20120, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the notion of a cityline, but the murky looking water doesn''t make the scene very appealing.</td>', 'i like the notion of a cityline, but the murky looking water doesn''t make the scene very appealing.', '2003-05-09 01:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(292711, 20437, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good tones in the stone. I think this would have benefitted from a border.</td>', 'Good tones in the stone. I think this would have benefitted from a border.', '2003-05-09 01:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292713, 20411, 7711, '<td valign="top">few of the highlights seem blown out, but this is a great shot, with beautiful colours and magnificent composition!</td>', 'few of the highlights seem blown out, but this is a great shot, with beautiful colours and magnificent composition!', '2003-05-09 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(292716, 20478, 7711, '<td valign="top">not as keen on the font as I am on the shot. Lovely composition, I like the choice of portrait! :)</td>', 'not as keen on the font as I am on the shot. Lovely composition, I like the choice of portrait! :)', '2003-05-09 01:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292722, 20254, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good composition. A little too softly focused IMO.</td>', 'Good composition. A little too softly focused IMO.', '2003-05-09 01:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(292723, 20454, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice setting. The color of the text is not such a good match - it is hard to see - maybe white.</td>', 'Nice setting. The color of the text is not such a good match - it is hard to see - maybe white.', '2003-05-09 01:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(292726, 20262, 6325, '<td valign="top">The dark sand would have been a good spot for some test to identify the location.</td>', 'The dark sand would have been a good spot for some test to identify the location.', '2003-05-09 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(292732, 20335, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. The mist on the water against the sharp pillars is a good touch. However, attention to details is important - needs to be straigtened. A white border would have been a good touch.</td>', 'Nice colors. The mist on the water against the sharp pillars is a good touch. However, attention to details is important - needs to be straigtened. A white border would have been a good touch.', '2003-05-09 01:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(292733, 20523, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous natural framing. Superbly composed!</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous natural framing. Superbly composed!', '2003-05-09 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(292735, 20521, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the photo. The border color, size, and text are well suited to the subject.</td>', 'Like the photo. The border color, size, and text are well suited to the subject.', '2003-05-09 01:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(292736, 20207, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very serene and peaceful scene. Well photograped. I would like to see it.</td>', 'Very serene and peaceful scene. Well photograped. I would like to see it.', '2003-05-09 01:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(292743, 20442, 7711, '<td valign="top">very postcard like, and I like the spill over of the text, though I bet lots said they didn''t like it! :)</td>', 'very postcard like, and I like the spill over of the text, though I bet lots said they didn''t like it! :)', '2003-05-09 02:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(292745, 20384, 7711, '<td valign="top">wow, what a view! Very nice capture. There is a slight bit of a white cast over all of it..maybe the contrast or brightness is off? Or maybe its just mountain mist! ;)</td>', 'wow, what a view! Very nice capture. There is a slight bit of a white cast over all of it..maybe the contrast or brightness is off? Or maybe its just mountain mist! ;)', '2003-05-09 02:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(292746, 20240, 7711, '<td valign="top">your horizon is a bit titled. A slight rotation to the right (clockwise) a degree or so, would probably fix it! :) Love the colours though.</td>', 'your horizon is a bit titled. A slight rotation to the right (clockwise) a degree or so, would probably fix it! :) Love the colours though.', '2003-05-09 02:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(292748, 20481, 7711, '<td valign="top">i love it. The inclusion of the man on the far off cliff is just the right touch! :) Spectacular view!</td>', 'i love it. The inclusion of the man on the far off cliff is just the right touch! :) Spectacular view!', '2003-05-09 02:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(292749, 20363, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think I would have rathered the building wasn''t desaturated, but in grey it does have a more "classic" and old feel to it.</td>', 'I think I would have rathered the building wasn''t desaturated, but in grey it does have a more "classic" and old feel to it.', '2003-05-09 02:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(292753, 20446, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the quaint and quietness of this picture. Shows a different, less "brash" side of texas. :) And the composition and DOF are extremely well done.</td>', 'i like the quaint and quietness of this picture. Shows a different, less "brash" side of texas. :) And the composition and DOF are extremely well done.', '2003-05-09 02:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(292787, 20342, 5728, '<td valign="top">It is a little on the dark side which for a postcard is not always so advantageous. The composition is good using the natural framing. However I would have gone a few steps higher to include more of the building into your shot.</td>', 'It is a little on the dark side which for a postcard is not always so advantageous. The composition is good using the natural framing. However I would have gone a few steps higher to include more of the building into your shot.', '2003-05-09 04:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(292788, 20440, 5728, '<td valign="top">Although this isn''t really a wow photo it does have it''s good points. Using the trees on the sides as natural framing works well. The focus is good and the composition as well and the framing fits the image. I find that the saturation could be increased and that the blue text doesn''t really fit to the pic.</td>', 'Although this isn''t really a wow photo it does have it''s good points. Using the trees on the sides as natural framing works well. The focus is good and the composition as well and the framing fits the image. I find that the saturation could be increased and that the blue text doesn''t really fit to the pic.', '2003-05-09 05:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(292791, 20514, 5728, '<td valign="top">What is interesting about this postcard is the layering effect. You got 4 layers: sky, hills, town, trees which makes for a good composition.</td>', 'What is interesting about this postcard is the layering effect. You got 4 layers: sky, hills, town, trees which makes for a good composition.', '2003-05-09 05:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292792, 20209, 6893, '<td valign="top">Yes this is the summer spot for all the great ones.</td>', 'Yes this is the summer spot for all the great ones.', '2003-05-09 05:20:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(292793, 20213, 5728, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo which just screams "postcard"! The frame is not really enhancing the photo too much though, but of course that is personal opinion.</td>', 'A beautiful photo which just screams "postcard"! The frame is not really enhancing the photo too much though, but of course that is personal opinion.', '2003-05-09 05:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(292796, 20309, 5728, '<td valign="top">Point no Point? Is that really the name of the place? What a pity it was overcast on this day, imagine the effect a crisp blue sky would have created. Otherwise a good photo taken from the most promising position.</td>', 'Point no Point? Is that really the name of the place? What a pity it was overcast on this day, imagine the effect a crisp blue sky would have created. Otherwise a good photo taken from the most promising position.', '2003-05-09 05:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(292800, 20457, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very very typical! You have taken a postcard shot as close to the postcard cliche as possible, well done. I particularly like the angle of this shot.</td>', 'Very very typical! You have taken a postcard shot as close to the postcard cliche as possible, well done. I particularly like the angle of this shot.', '2003-05-09 05:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(292801, 20375, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, very postcard, very good.</td>', 'Very colorful, very postcard, very good.', '2003-05-09 05:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(292802, 20515, 5728, '<td valign="top">The crispy deep blue sky gives this photo so much impact. The perspective you have chosen works well. The color of the framing is not really for me, but that is just personal opinion.</td>', 'The crispy deep blue sky gives this photo so much impact. The perspective you have chosen works well. The color of the framing is not really for me, but that is just personal opinion.', '2003-05-09 05:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(292804, 20209, 5728, '<td valign="top">The image appears a little on the soft side but other than that a typical postcard pic taken from the best angle possible.</td>', 'The image appears a little on the soft side but other than that a typical postcard pic taken from the best angle possible.', '2003-05-09 05:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(292806, 20504, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome effect! The building really look as if they have been pasted into the pic, you have got them outlined so sharp against the background, good stuff! Imagine the effect you could have created had the sky been a deep blue color? Wow!</td>', 'Awesome effect! The building really look as if they have been pasted into the pic, you have got them outlined so sharp against the background, good stuff! Imagine the effect you could have created had the sky been a deep blue color? Wow!', '2003-05-09 05:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(292807, 20332, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is an interesting shot, it sure is original. I like the perspective and composition.</td>', 'Now this is an interesting shot, it sure is original. I like the perspective and composition.', '2003-05-09 05:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292808, 20379, 5728, '<td valign="top">Must be England!! Never been to Chorley before, it looks pretty rural though. I like the Old English countryside effect you''ve created, you have a good eye.</td>', 'Must be England!! Never been to Chorley before, it looks pretty rural though. I like the Old English countryside effect you''ve created, you have a good eye.', '2003-05-09 05:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(292809, 20375, 3540, '<td valign="top">What this photo needs is some more room on top and a lot more room on the left.  This tractor, even in this shape, needs somewhere to go and some room to get there.   Pretty much I''m saying take this pic (or crop it) with a little more room on top and about a third the length of this picture added on the left.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck</td>', 'What this photo needs is some more room on top and a lot more room on the left.  This tractor, even in this shape, needs somewhere to go and some room to get there.   Pretty much I''m saying take this pic (or crop it) with a little more room on top and about a third the length of this picture added on the left.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck', '2003-05-09 05:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(292810, 20322, 5728, '<td valign="top">It''s postcard stuff alright, well done. Only thing I''d change would be to boost the saturation a little to bring out the colors more.</td>', 'It''s postcard stuff alright, well done. Only thing I''d change would be to boost the saturation a little to bring out the colors more.', '2003-05-09 05:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(292811, 19823, 3540, '<td valign="top">Stopping at the cafe to get a cup of coffee and some Hotdish.  Looks like pretty flat typical small town middle America.  Great sky color.  The building looks a little underexposed.</td>', 'Stopping at the cafe to get a cup of coffee and some Hotdish.  Looks like pretty flat typical small town middle America.  Great sky color.  The building looks a little underexposed.', '2003-05-09 05:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(292812, 20353, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is a postcard! The framing and text fit in well, exactly what I would expect to find on any San Fancisco postcard stand.</td>', 'Now this is a postcard! The framing and text fit in well, exactly what I would expect to find on any San Fancisco postcard stand.', '2003-05-09 05:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(292813, 20518, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion panning technique.  Very well done.  Catchy title too.  Great capture good luck</td>', 'Good stop motion panning technique.  Very well done.  Catchy title too.  Great capture good luck', '2003-05-09 05:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(292815, 20370, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is crowding the tall building just a little.  Great shot at dusk.  REally nice work.</td>', 'I think the crop is crowding the tall building just a little.  Great shot at dusk.  REally nice work.', '2003-05-09 05:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(292820, 20439, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape.  Good crop, everything has room but not too much.  sky color is pretty good too.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great cityscape.  Good crop, everything has room but not too much.  sky color is pretty good too.  Nice work.', '2003-05-09 05:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(292822, 20411, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  The sky is gorgeous as is all the vegetation.  Really nice job with this - 9</td>', 'Great subject.  The sky is gorgeous as is all the vegetation.  Really nice job with this - 9', '2003-05-09 05:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(292824, 20336, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo.  Great contrast with the sky and the colors are intense.  Good job with this photo and good luck.  I''m going to go build one of these in my kitchen now.   Thanks for the inspiration J/K!!</td>', 'Very well taken photo.  Great contrast with the sky and the colors are intense.  Good job with this photo and good luck.  I''m going to go build one of these in my kitchen now.   Thanks for the inspiration J/K!!', '2003-05-09 05:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(292827, 20154, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think you need to be careful about being too exact about locations.  You''ve definitely narrowed this one down as to who this might be.  I recently critiqued a photo with a similar location of 2 angels and a cross with Celtic knots.  About the picture, I couldn''t do it better myself.   Very nice shot and very well done. - 9</td>', 'I think you need to be careful about being too exact about locations.  You''ve definitely narrowed this one down as to who this might be.  I recently critiqued a photo with a similar location of 2 angels and a cross with Celtic knots.  About the picture, I couldn''t do it better myself.   Very nice shot and very well done. - 9', '2003-05-09 05:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(292829, 20138, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great city scape.  Wish the sky was bluer though.   Water is remarkably calm and this is a really neat shot.  Good luck</td>', 'Great city scape.  Wish the sky was bluer though.   Water is remarkably calm and this is a really neat shot.  Good luck', '2003-05-09 05:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(292832, 20543, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good angle, good crop, nice sky color.  All around a solid well taken shot.</td>', 'Good angle, good crop, nice sky color.  All around a solid well taken shot.', '2003-05-09 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(292834, 20521, 3540, '<td valign="top">Now this is a postcard.  Very well done.  Sunsets make for such good postcards.  You''re my first 10 this week.  Nice work</td>', 'Now this is a postcard.  Very well done.  Sunsets make for such good postcards.  You''re my first 10 this week.  Nice work', '2003-05-09 06:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(292857, 20424, 4906, '<td valign="top">The one at the back is doing push-ups!</td>', 'The one at the back is doing push-ups!', '2003-05-09 07:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(292858, 20168, 4906, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the font used, but the image is stunning.</td>', 'Not sure about the font used, but the image is stunning.', '2003-05-09 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(292912, 20424, 6999, '<td valign="top">God, haven''t seen these things in years - they must be pretty old now? Like the shot - DOF especially. Text doesn''t read too well - I guess that''s a function of the resolution of the upload more than the curly script. And what else is there to shoot in MK?</td>', 'God, haven''t seen these things in years - they must be pretty old now? Like the shot - DOF especially. Text doesn''t read too well - I guess that''s a function of the resolution of the upload more than the curly script. And what else is there to shoot in MK?', '2003-05-09 08:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(292913, 20519, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I think perhaps too much contrast - though that''s obviously difficult to keep the sky from burning out. Graduated filter might have helped? Don''t like the text layout: I think perhaps there''s too much of it.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I think perhaps too much contrast - though that''s obviously difficult to keep the sky from burning out. Graduated filter might have helped? Don''t like the text layout: I think perhaps there''s too much of it.', '2003-05-09 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(292915, 19947, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work: think it would sell. You''d need to clean up some of that noise in the sky though - quite distracting. Have you tried Neatimage - it works wonders for that stuff.</td>', 'Good work: think it would sell. You''d need to clean up some of that noise in the sky though - quite distracting. Have you tried Neatimage - it works wonders for that stuff.', '2003-05-09 08:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(292916, 20449, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shot - as to postcard-ness, I think you could either have cropped just under where you''ve placed the text, or put the text lower down: it looks like a mistake being that far up the frame.</td>', 'Good shot - as to postcard-ness, I think you could either have cropped just under where you''ve placed the text, or put the text lower down: it looks like a mistake being that far up the frame.', '2003-05-09 08:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(292919, 20428, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the sepia - and I know Elm Hill very well indeed: used to drink round there often, a few years ago.Like the text and bordering though, and nice to see the place here.</td>', 'Not sure about the sepia - and I know Elm Hill very well indeed: used to drink round there often, a few years ago.Like the text and bordering though, and nice to see the place here.', '2003-05-09 08:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(293090, 20457, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice use of line to draw our eye up the beach! The lighting and tones do not really make this look like an inviting, engaging place to go, though.</td>', 'Nice use of line to draw our eye up the beach! The lighting and tones do not really make this look like an inviting, engaging place to go, though.', '2003-05-09 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(293093, 20317, 6870, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of colors against each other to create this pastiche of place. Looks very much oversharpened.</td>', 'wonderful use of colors against each other to create this pastiche of place. Looks very much oversharpened.', '2003-05-09 10:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293094, 20518, 6870, '<td valign="top">I kind of dread cars and lots of traffic, but your bright colors and capture of motion really make this city seem attractive to me. Good thing: I\''m coming there in July/August! Nice work here! 10</td>', 'I kind of dread cars and lots of traffic, but your bright colors and capture of motion really make this city seem attractive to me. Good thing: I\''m coming there in July/August! Nice work here! 10', '2003-05-09 10:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(293095, 20503, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very enticing. Can I come? You\''ve captured this skyline wonderfully, and I want to go to Montreal now. 10</td>', 'Very enticing. Can I come? You\''ve captured this skyline wonderfully, and I want to go to Montreal now. 10', '2003-05-09 10:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(293096, 20334, 6870, '<td valign="top">Some may see this as "digital art" rather than "photography," but I LOVE this! You make the poppy both engaging and mysterious! 10</td>', 'Some may see this as "digital art" rather than "photography," but I LOVE this! You make the poppy both engaging and mysterious! 10', '2003-05-09 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(293097, 20417, 6870, '<td valign="top">Stunning lines and colors and focus. I do indeed want to go to Manchester after seeing this image. Can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag? 10</td>', 'Stunning lines and colors and focus. I do indeed want to go to Manchester after seeing this image. Can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag? 10', '2003-05-09 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293098, 20336, 6870, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot as this monument rises dramatically amongst all of that color. Sky adds drama, too. I''m waiting for UFOs to land there.</td>', 'GREAT shot as this monument rises dramatically amongst all of that color. Sky adds drama, too. I''m waiting for UFOs to land there.', '2003-05-09 10:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(293099, 20368, 6870, '<td valign="top">I LOVE Baingridge Island! We have friends there and want to come visit soon. if we do, we''ll look you up, too! Oh--this is a good photo, too. I think some folks may want to see those beautiful mountains more than the ferry, but the ferry IS the way of life on that island! Nice work!</td>', 'I LOVE Baingridge Island! We have friends there and want to come visit soon. if we do, we''ll look you up, too! Oh--this is a good photo, too. I think some folks may want to see those beautiful mountains more than the ferry, but the ferry IS the way of life on that island! Nice work!', '2003-05-09 10:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(293100, 20383, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light captured here. Nice use of line to draw my eye through the picture.</td>', 'Wonderful light captured here. Nice use of line to draw my eye through the picture.', '2003-05-09 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(293340, 20511, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a wildly well done photo!  I''m having a hard time seeing this as a postcard, maybe a greeting card (sympathy - don''t be down...sort of thing).  The focus and composition are wonderful!  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'This is a wildly well done photo!  I''m having a hard time seeing this as a postcard, maybe a greeting card (sympathy - don''t be down...sort of thing).  The focus and composition are wonderful!  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293342, 20525, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good focus and color!  The foreground cow seems just as strongly composed as the background one!  The sand/dirt flooring isn''t exactly a letter perfect setting, but that''s a nit.  9 Rob the Swash  (love the expression of the front most cow!)</td>', 'Very good focus and color!  The foreground cow seems just as strongly composed as the background one!  The sand/dirt flooring isn''t exactly a letter perfect setting, but that''s a nit.  9 Rob the Swash  (love the expression of the front most cow!)', '2003-05-09 14:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(293344, 20434, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good colors!  Too bad about the hazy sky, with just about any other sky this would have been a 10, I know you can''t control the weather, sorry.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very good colors!  Too bad about the hazy sky, with just about any other sky this would have been a 10, I know you can''t control the weather, sorry.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(293348, 20411, 1005, '<td valign="top">Epitomy of postcard!  Focus is very strong, color is wonderful, lighting and shading are very nice, intersting.  You win, score upgrade from 9 to 10.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Epitomy of postcard!  Focus is very strong, color is wonderful, lighting and shading are very nice, intersting.  You win, score upgrade from 9 to 10.  Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(293353, 20370, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this postcard! (kidding!)  Very good shot.  This is exactly what I would expect to see.  Very well shot.  The soft blur of the water is wonderfully satin.  The skyline is very nice.  (Small nit about alignment of the top of the fountain and the building background, but really!)  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I''ve seen this postcard! (kidding!)  Very good shot.  This is exactly what I would expect to see.  Very well shot.  The soft blur of the water is wonderfully satin.  The skyline is very nice.  (Small nit about alignment of the top of the fountain and the building background, but really!)  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(293354, 20456, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very, very good shot!  Focus is wonderful.  Color seems very true.  I''d have liked the building a bit brighter, but that''s a nit.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very, very good shot!  Focus is wonderful.  Color seems very true.  I''d have liked the building a bit brighter, but that''s a nit.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(293357, 20254, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Strong postcard feel.  The sky isn''t "perfect", but that''s weather and this is pretty darn good anyway.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  Strong postcard feel.  The sky isn''t "perfect", but that''s weather and this is pretty darn good anyway.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(293359, 20336, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Looks like a post card to me!  I really like the accented patch of red ground.  (Small nit - the watering thingy, damn!)  Cool, dramatic sky.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very well done!  Looks like a post card to me!  I really like the accented patch of red ground.  (Small nit - the watering thingy, damn!)  Cool, dramatic sky.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(293363, 20353, 1005, '<td valign="top">Excellent postcard!  Two issues in the awe too bad catagory, the graffitti on the sign and the hazy day....oh, damn.  I really like your tranparent lettering.  Catching the traincar in the frame was a great (but necessary) element.  9  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Excellent postcard!  Two issues in the awe too bad catagory, the graffitti on the sign and the hazy day....oh, damn.  I really like your tranparent lettering.  Catching the traincar in the frame was a great (but necessary) element.  9  Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293367, 20368, 1005, '<td valign="top">The Wenatchee in the foreground and the Olympics in the background, it doesn''t get much more Washington than that!  Nice postcard.  I like the angle of the ferries'' approach.  You seem to have the same purplish clouds that ppl complained to me about.  I like it, I like it very much!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'The Wenatchee in the foreground and the Olympics in the background, it doesn''t get much more Washington than that!  Nice postcard.  I like the angle of the ferries'' approach.  You seem to have the same purplish clouds that ppl complained to me about.  I like it, I like it very much!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(293369, 20427, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fun shot!  I''m more seeing this as photojournalism than postcard.  Color is good, but the white is a bit strong.  (Ouch on the background)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Fun shot!  I''m more seeing this as photojournalism than postcard.  Color is good, but the white is a bit strong.  (Ouch on the background)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(293371, 20213, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the font and clouds and composition of this image. I feel the snowy hill in the foreground should either get more focus or less. As is, it kind of attracts attention just because it is white, so it steals attention away from the rest of this lovely image. It also makes the greenery at left quite dark in contrast.</td>', 'I love the font and clouds and composition of this image. I feel the snowy hill in the foreground should either get more focus or less. As is, it kind of attracts attention just because it is white, so it steals attention away from the rest of this lovely image. It also makes the greenery at left quite dark in contrast.', '2003-05-09 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(293373, 20342, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  This is a very nice angle and subject for a postcard shot, but the glare on the roof is so very harsh.  This might have been a bit better at a different time of day.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty scene.  This is a very nice angle and subject for a postcard shot, but the glare on the roof is so very harsh.  This might have been a bit better at a different time of day.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-05-09 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(293375, 20456, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and clouds. The greenery in front really grounds the image well. INteresting light,too.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and clouds. The greenery in front really grounds the image well. INteresting light,too.', '2003-05-09 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293378, 20356, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Good choice to have us peeking over the flowers to see the waterfall! I like the waterfall out of focus, however the flowers seem slightly out of focus, too. Still nice light and great work.</td>', 'Lovely composition. Good choice to have us peeking over the flowers to see the waterfall! I like the waterfall out of focus, however the flowers seem slightly out of focus, too. Still nice light and great work.', '2003-05-09 14:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293380, 20207, 6870, '<td valign="top">YOur photo does indeed make me want to visit this place! THe tones are wonderful and the water creates a line that leads my eye around the image.</td>', 'YOur photo does indeed make me want to visit this place! THe tones are wonderful and the water creates a line that leads my eye around the image.', '2003-05-09 14:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(293381, 20528, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks bright and sunny and I like your point of vew here. Good capture of clouds.</td>', 'Looks bright and sunny and I like your point of vew here. Good capture of clouds.', '2003-05-09 14:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(293383, 20364, 6870, '<td valign="top">The paddle wheel is foremost in this shot, and it looks like a fun place. Nice use of light and composition.</td>', 'The paddle wheel is foremost in this shot, and it looks like a fun place. Nice use of light and composition.', '2003-05-09 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(293394, 20395, 1717, '<td valign="top">oooh, beautiful!  i love how the rocks and trees frame the falls.  nice, bright white withough being blown out.  good work!</td>', 'oooh, beautiful!  i love how the rocks and trees frame the falls.  nice, bright white withough being blown out.  good work!', '2003-05-09 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(293397, 20268, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love the simplicity of this photo.  beautiful, bright colors without being blown out.  the only thing i would change is that blue border.  it really doesn''t do justice to the photo.</td>', 'i love the simplicity of this photo.  beautiful, bright colors without being blown out.  the only thing i would change is that blue border.  it really doesn''t do justice to the photo.', '2003-05-09 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(293398, 20419, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view and lovely composition. Light seems a bit harsh, but this is certainly a place I want to go someday! Can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag?<br/></td>', 'Nice point of view and lovely composition. Light seems a bit harsh, but this is certainly a place I want to go someday! Can I sleep on your floor if I bring my own sleeping bag?', '2003-05-09 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293400, 20514, 6870, '<td valign="top">...and I always  just thought that Billings was a big trailer park! Just kidding. Nice shot, esecially  how you show Billings to be in its environment fo mountians and big sky.</td>', '...and I always  just thought that Billings was a big trailer park! Just kidding. Nice shot, esecially  how you show Billings to be in its environment fo mountians and big sky.', '2003-05-09 14:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(293402, 20516, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your point of view makes this building come to life in 3-D as it were. The light isn''t very interesting, but your composition and focus are great.</td>', 'Your point of view makes this building come to life in 3-D as it were. The light isn''t very interesting, but your composition and focus are great.', '2003-05-09 14:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(293429, 20207, 3102, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful!  My only nitpick would be that this could easily be any lake anywhere -- it would be cool to see something that made it more "local" -- but I''m still giving this a rare 10!</td>', 'Just beautiful!  My only nitpick would be that this could easily be any lake anywhere -- it would be cool to see something that made it more "local" -- but I''m still giving this a rare 10!', '2003-05-09 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(293435, 20439, 3102, '<td valign="top">You could have included their new slogan:  "Toronto:  You *Probably* Won''t Catch SARS!"  :)  Seriously, it''s a nice shot -- excellent sky, too.  A great vantage point, especially once the trees get some more green on them, too!</td>', 'You could have included their new slogan:  "Toronto:  You *Probably* Won''t Catch SARS!"  :)  Seriously, it''s a nice shot -- excellent sky, too.  A great vantage point, especially once the trees get some more green on them, too!', '2003-05-09 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(293438, 20375, 3102, '<td valign="top">Funny subject -- could indeed be the subject of a postcard!  The red of the tractor seems to blend in a bit too much with the background (the reds overall seem a bit overbearing), but still a cool shot.</td>', 'Funny subject -- could indeed be the subject of a postcard!  The red of the tractor seems to blend in a bit too much with the background (the reds overall seem a bit overbearing), but still a cool shot.', '2003-05-09 15:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(293442, 20405, 3102, '<td valign="top">A charming-looking place!  A nice, tastefully done shot with appropriately tasteful text.  Definitely the kind of shot that makes me want to visit!</td>', 'A charming-looking place!  A nice, tastefully done shot with appropriately tasteful text.  Definitely the kind of shot that makes me want to visit!', '2003-05-09 15:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(293455, 20168, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I would prefer a greater difference between the blues in the arch and the blues in the sky, but that may not be possible without masking. Also, I''d not use italics because the slant competes with the slant of the lines behind the text. Otherwise an excellent photo.</td>', 'Great composition! I would prefer a greater difference between the blues in the arch and the blues in the sky, but that may not be possible without masking. Also, I''d not use italics because the slant competes with the slant of the lines behind the text. Otherwise an excellent photo.', '2003-05-09 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(293463, 20478, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''d find the text less distracting if it were all together in the upper right corner</td>', 'I''d find the text less distracting if it were all together in the upper right corner', '2003-05-09 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(293466, 20454, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wish the text wasn''t there! Okay, the ''California Foothills'' is fine, but the rest is way too distracting. Otherwise an excellent photo, and indeed captures that hand-colored feel.</td>', 'Wish the text wasn''t there! Okay, the ''California Foothills'' is fine, but the rest is way too distracting. Otherwise an excellent photo, and indeed captures that hand-colored feel.', '2003-05-09 15:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293476, 20213, 7485, '<td valign="top">Frame is a bit too much, and the photo pulls the eye all over. I like the near mountain and the ''Alpine Meadows'' is nicely done, but the cloud in upper left and the text lower left is distracting.</td>', 'Frame is a bit too much, and the photo pulls the eye all over. I like the near mountain and the ''Alpine Meadows'' is nicely done, but the cloud in upper left and the text lower left is distracting.', '2003-05-09 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293480, 20456, 7485, '<td valign="top">As an actual postcard, I''m sure this one would sell really well. But I''d prefer something more dramatic or less traditional.</td>', 'As an actual postcard, I''m sure this one would sell really well. But I''d prefer something more dramatic or less traditional.', '2003-05-09 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(293483, 20482, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I particularly like the bit of light under the heel. However, I would give the text more room (maybe smaller font and run it horizontally in the upper right corner?)</td>', 'Great idea! I particularly like the bit of light under the heel. However, I would give the text more room (maybe smaller font and run it horizontally in the upper right corner?)', '2003-05-09 16:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(293487, 20497, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cool building! If there wasn''t anything distracting there, I would have included more at the bottom. It would be nice to see three archs extending all the way to the right. Also, there''s no benefit to having two fonts (I''d use the bottom one for both, and give the text a little more space.</td>', 'Cool building! If there wasn''t anything distracting there, I would have included more at the bottom. It would be nice to see three archs extending all the way to the right. Also, there''s no benefit to having two fonts (I''d use the bottom one for both, and give the text a little more space.', '2003-05-09 16:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(293488, 20317, 6999, '<td valign="top">Mark (this has to be you, doesn''t it?) - what i really like about this is that it has the slightly over-exposed quality that so many postcards have (few shadows, very bright, no moodiness), and that you''ve cropped it to pretty much the right dimensions. You get a 6 - though tbh I haven''t really decided what I''m looking for in the challenge - ''typical'' postcard, or one that I''d buy ... Could certainly imagine this in one of the shops by the harbour there, or scribbled on with ''our holiday flat'' and an arrow in biro.</td>', 'Mark (this has to be you, doesn''t it?) - what i really like about this is that it has the slightly over-exposed quality that so many postcards have (few shadows, very bright, no moodiness), and that you''ve cropped it to pretty much the right dimensions. You get a 6 - though tbh I haven''t really decided what I''m looking for in the challenge - ''typical'' postcard, or one that I''d buy ... Could certainly imagine this in one of the shops by the harbour there, or scribbled on with ''our holiday flat'' and an arrow in biro.', '2003-05-09 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(293498, 20353, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I don''t know about the graffiti.</td>', 'Good idea, but I don''t know about the graffiti.', '2003-05-09 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(293499, 20269, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great use of text!</td>', 'Great use of text!', '2003-05-09 16:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(293502, 20504, 7485, '<td valign="top">The white background and flat light work against a good composition</td>', 'The white background and flat light work against a good composition', '2003-05-09 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(293505, 20334, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative!</td>', 'Very imaginative!', '2003-05-09 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(293510, 20336, 7485, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors! Would a more horizontal crop be even better? Loosing some of the white clouds and a bit of the grass would focus the image more.</td>', 'beautiful colors! Would a more horizontal crop be even better? Loosing some of the white clouds and a bit of the grass would focus the image more.', '2003-05-09 16:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(293514, 20267, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, but the blue cast and saturated whites are a problem</td>', 'Very good composition, but the blue cast and saturated whites are a problem', '2003-05-09 16:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(293518, 20363, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the color isn''t saturated enough to really stand out from the gray</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the color isn''t saturated enough to really stand out from the gray', '2003-05-09 16:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(293523, 20395, 7485, '<td valign="top">The dark gradient on the sky is great!</td>', 'The dark gradient on the sky is great!', '2003-05-09 16:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(293528, 20518, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and very well done. Just to nitpick, maybe a more modern/exciting font would be more appropriate?</td>', 'Great idea, and very well done. Just to nitpick, maybe a more modern/exciting font would be more appropriate?', '2003-05-09 16:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(293542, 20448, 7485, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know they had added a hot spring by Perlan! I would prefer it with a little less foreground and a little more sky (give the text more space), but still a great shot.</td>', 'I didn''t know they had added a hot spring by Perlan! I would prefer it with a little less foreground and a little more sky (give the text more space), but still a great shot.', '2003-05-09 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(293547, 20457, 7485, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty serious tilt there...</td>', 'That''s a pretty serious tilt there...', '2003-05-09 17:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(293550, 20446, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great building and horse, not sure about the foreground and that branch in particular</td>', 'Great building and horse, not sure about the foreground and that branch in particular', '2003-05-09 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(293555, 20335, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I''d prefer the text on the top right, to use the natural black framing. Also, if you rotated the photo to straighten the columns, would anyone notice the slightly tilted horizon?</td>', 'Great idea, but I''d prefer the text on the top right, to use the natural black framing. Also, if you rotated the photo to straighten the columns, would anyone notice the slightly tilted horizon?', '2003-05-09 17:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(293562, 20274, 7711, '<td valign="top">Love the captioning! :) The front building is a bit too shadowed, maybe shooting at a different time of day, or a different method of metering would have helped?</td>', 'Love the captioning! :) The front building is a bit too shadowed, maybe shooting at a different time of day, or a different method of metering would have helped?', '2003-05-09 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(293565, 20317, 7711, '<td valign="top">loves a bit oversharp, there is a loss of smoothness and lots of jaggies on the edges of the boats and some of the buildings!</td>', 'loves a bit oversharp, there is a loss of smoothness and lots of jaggies on the edges of the boats and some of the buildings!', '2003-05-09 17:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(293570, 20540, 7711, '<td valign="top">:) Maybe a head on shot or a closer view on the angle would give a little more impact to this cafe. Also, it seems quite a bit out of focus.</td>', ':) Maybe a head on shot or a closer view on the angle would give a little more impact to this cafe. Also, it seems quite a bit out of focus.', '2003-05-09 17:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(293573, 20253, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice effect with the telescope sort of tunnel view, though I''m not sure its my favourite thing with that much black around it. I also like your choice of sepia, it goes with the captioning well. :)</td>', 'nice effect with the telescope sort of tunnel view, though I''m not sure its my favourite thing with that much black around it. I also like your choice of sepia, it goes with the captioning well. :)', '2003-05-09 17:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(293575, 20435, 7711, '<td valign="top">the soft focus is nice and softens the look of the pricks so they aren''t that uninviting!</td>', 'the soft focus is nice and softens the look of the pricks so they aren''t that uninviting!', '2003-05-09 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(293577, 20356, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think I would have liked to see the water fall more in focus. maybe more DOF or throw the foreground elements out of focus to get the water? Just a couple of ideas!</td>', 'i think I would have liked to see the water fall more in focus. maybe more DOF or throw the foreground elements out of focus to get the water? Just a couple of ideas!', '2003-05-09 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(293580, 20536, 7711, '<td valign="top">the composition makes berkeley seem dark, stormy and unfriendly! Not sure if that is the look you were going for.</td>', 'the composition makes berkeley seem dark, stormy and unfriendly! Not sure if that is the look you were going for.', '2003-05-09 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(293584, 20517, 7711, '<td valign="top">very gothic sort of subject choice! I would have preferred a closer view of it though, as it is very small in comparision to the all the foreground.</td>', 'very gothic sort of subject choice! I would have preferred a closer view of it though, as it is very small in comparision to the all the foreground.', '2003-05-09 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(293588, 20504, 7711, '<td valign="top">very neat idea with an older style building next to a very modern one! says a lot about dallas! :) Would have been nicer if the sky co-operated and gave you some blue! Did you try using a polarizing filter or something in post production?</td>', 'very neat idea with an older style building next to a very modern one! says a lot about dallas! :) Would have been nicer if the sky co-operated and gave you some blue! Did you try using a polarizing filter or something in post production?', '2003-05-09 17:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(293610, 20454, 7711, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this does look hand coloured. Very unique and lovely composition!</td>', 'I really like the way this does look hand coloured. Very unique and lovely composition!', '2003-05-09 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(293810, 20337, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the man in your shot, has a great feel to the shot. The building seems a bit dark and purple to me, but I think it might be my monitor, if it is indeed dark and purple, maybe a fiddle in PS would have solved? :)</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the man in your shot, has a great feel to the shot. The building seems a bit dark and purple to me, but I think it might be my monitor, if it is indeed dark and purple, maybe a fiddle in PS would have solved? :)', '2003-05-09 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(293812, 20462, 7711, '<td valign="top">I would have loved a bit more light on the buddha''s face. Otherwise, super composition, I like the greenery in the background.</td>', 'I would have loved a bit more light on the buddha''s face. Otherwise, super composition, I like the greenery in the background.', '2003-05-09 21:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(293813, 20335, 7711, '<td valign="top">very serene and warm mood created by the sunset and the silohuettes, I like the way you''ve framed the sun using the archway.</td>', 'very serene and warm mood created by the sunset and the silohuettes, I like the way you''ve framed the sun using the archway.', '2003-05-09 21:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(293818, 20254, 7711, '<td valign="top">really love the shape of these red rocks cutting into the light blue sky. Has a very rough and tumble "wild west" feel to it, and very natural! well done. 9</td>', 'really love the shape of these red rocks cutting into the light blue sky. Has a very rough and tumble "wild west" feel to it, and very natural! well done. 9', '2003-05-09 21:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
