(294991, 20518, 7613, '<td valign="top">having the Cab frozen in time with the movement all about it would have given a very interesting shot. I like what you have done with the concept however!! 7</td>', 'having the Cab frozen in time with the movement all about it would have given a very interesting shot. I like what you have done with the concept however!! 7', '2003-05-11 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
