(295169, 20432, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Terry, on a top ten finish and DPC "Personal Record" 6.864!<br/> <br/>Again, this was one of my top three picks for this challenge. The reasons - Excellant composition, color, framing and exceptionally well suited for this challenge. It is simple and elegantly understated; exactly what a quiet, rural community would want.</td>', 'Congrats, Terry, on a top ten finish and DPC "Personal Record" 6.864! Again, this was one of my top three picks for this challenge. The reasons - Excellant composition, color, framing and exceptionally well suited for this challenge. It is simple and elegantly understated; exactly what a quiet, rural community would want.', '2003-05-12 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(295176, 20521, 5120, '<td valign="top">Great picture! With a score this high I am surprised it didn''t place higher.<br/> <br/>Greg</td>', 'Great picture! With a score this high I am surprised it didn''t place higher. Greg', '2003-05-12 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(295192, 20501, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Hmm. Well I like it!  It looks like many folks wanted more land in the shot, but I happen to feel that water can be, and here is, just as interesting and engaging. Great shot Mav!</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Hmm. Well I like it!  It looks like many folks wanted more land in the shot, but I happen to feel that water can be, and here is, just as interesting and engaging. Great shot Mav!', '2003-05-12 02:41:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(295194, 20501, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Hmm. Well I like it!  It looks like many folks wanted more land in the shot, but I happen to feel that water can be, and here is, just as interesting and engaging. Great shot Mav!<br/> <br/>One thing about your photography, Mavrik--I never know what to expect from you! You''re delightfully all over the place! Now THAT''s exploration!</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do better. Hmm. Well I like it!  It looks like many folks wanted more land in the shot, but I happen to feel that water can be, and here is, just as interesting and engaging. Great shot Mav! One thing about your photography, Mavrik--I never know what to expect from you! You''re delightfully all over the place! Now THAT''s exploration!', '2003-05-12 02:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
