(295304, 20434, 3023, '<td valign="top">A big thanks to all who gave comments. <br/> <br/>The lighting this particular day was very grey and dull. I used "levels" a bit to brighten the colors. I didnt use it very much and when comparing to the original the change of sky is not striking. So the post processing was not really at fault causing the sky to be this blown out. I would like to blame my camera that almost doesnt offer any manual control... :) I will be upgrading soon, thats for sure... :)<br/></td>', 'A big thanks to all who gave comments.  The lighting this particular day was very grey and dull. I used "levels" a bit to brighten the colors. I didnt use it very much and when comparing to the original the change of sky is not striking. So the post processing was not really at fault causing the sky to be this blown out. I would like to blame my camera that almost doesnt offer any manual control... :) I will be upgrading soon, thats for sure... :)', '2003-05-12 05:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
