(296108, 20396, 5266, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.  I wish the lighting could have been better, but when working with the incredible tides here, it''s all in the timing!!  As it was, I came home with extremely muddy and wet shoes!!<br/> <br/>If you''d like to see more pics from this "most visited tourist attraction" in New Brunswick, then go to <a href="//www.pbase.com/kiml/the_hopewell_rocks" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">my PBase site</a>.  <br/> <br/>RE:  text - I thought we were to take a photo that would make a good postcard, not make a good postcard... oops!!!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone.  I wish the lighting could have been better, but when working with the incredible tides here, it''s all in the timing!!  As it was, I came home with extremely muddy and wet shoes!! If you''d like to see more pics from this "most visited tourist attraction" in New Brunswick, then go to my PBase site.   RE:  text - I thought we were to take a photo that would make a good postcard, not make a good postcard... oops!!!', '2003-05-12 21:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
