(453883, 20368, 9441, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  It is stunning, and definitely ''postcard'' quality. I like the mountains in the background, adds a lot of interest to the photo. The colors are fabulous, and you captured all the detail beautifully.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I love this photo!  It is stunning, and definitely ''postcard'' quality. I like the mountains in the background, adds a lot of interest to the photo. The colors are fabulous, and you captured all the detail beautifully.  Nicely done!', '2003-10-17 14:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
