(1885480, 20501, 43004, '<td valign="top">I really like how you made day look like night.  Probably not your intention, but I keep looking for the moon... (go figure, you know me). <br/>*giggle*<br/>If I''d seen this in a challenge, I would have given you a 7+</td>', 'I really like how you made day look like night.  Probably not your intention, but I keep looking for the moon... (go figure, you know me). *giggle*If I''d seen this in a challenge, I would have given you a 7+', '2005-11-20 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 0);
